(2533838, 350925, 59155, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting idea and I like how sharp you got the magnifying glass to be... I think the only problem is that it doesn''t really make sense why you''re using a magnifying glass about 5 feet away from a beach towel.  I think this picture might have made more sense had you used say, a newspaper out of focus in the background or a book or anything small like that.  That aside, I really do like the idea and the picture a lot!</td>', 'I think this is an interesting idea and I like how sharp you got the magnifying glass to be... I think the only problem is that it doesn''t really make sense why you''re using a magnifying glass about 5 feet away from a beach towel.  I think this picture might have made more sense had you used say, a newspaper out of focus in the background or a book or anything small like that.  That aside, I really do like the idea and the picture a lot!', '2006-06-21 01:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
