(2534011, 349594, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Love the color and composition and the bokeh definitely enhances the subject. One thing you might think about is using selective color to shift the whites a little towards yellow so that the highlights wouldn''t look that intense in the hot spots. Anyway, just a minor nitpick. As is it gets a 8 from me off the bat.</td>', 'Fantastic. Love the color and composition and the bokeh definitely enhances the subject. One thing you might think about is using selective color to shift the whites a little towards yellow so that the highlights wouldn''t look that intense in the hot spots. Anyway, just a minor nitpick. As is it gets a 8 from me off the bat.', '2006-06-21 01:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2534015, 349890, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and I like how the column in the background reflects the one the bird''s on.  What''s that next to the bird?  A little distracting, but a solid 8!</td>', 'Nice composition, and I like how the column in the background reflects the one the bird''s on.  What''s that next to the bird?  A little distracting, but a solid 8!', '2006-06-21 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
