(2535476, 350186, 48228, '<td valign="top">A little to busy re composition...</td>', 'A little to busy re composition...', '2006-06-21 09:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535478, 351048, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the glass.....</td>', 'I like the reflection of the glass.....', '2006-06-21 09:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535479, 349136, 48228, '<td valign="top">More like DOF than "Bokeh"...</td>', 'More like DOF than "Bokeh"...', '2006-06-21 09:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535488, 349347, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really lovely. Perfect example of bokeh.</td>', 'Really lovely. Perfect example of bokeh.', '2006-06-21 09:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535493, 349980, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The title is perfect.  The spring colors almost look like a painting. One of my favorites so far. 10</td>', 'Lovely. The title is perfect.  The spring colors almost look like a painting. One of my favorites so far. 10', '2006-06-21 09:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535498, 348947, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of bokeh. Love the detail on the bee. Great use of negative space as well.</td>', 'Perfect example of bokeh. Love the detail on the bee. Great use of negative space as well.', '2006-06-21 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535499, 349009, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would have so much more more impact if it were in color, but that''s just me. Nice detailing on the wings.</td>', 'I think this would have so much more more impact if it were in color, but that''s just me. Nice detailing on the wings.', '2006-06-21 09:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535501, 350241, 15711, '<td valign="top">So different and unexpected.  I like it.  Maybe a tad harsh on the lighting, but the corner and latch are tack sharp.  Nice job. 7</td>', 'So different and unexpected.  I like it.  Maybe a tad harsh on the lighting, but the corner and latch are tack sharp.  Nice job. 7', '2006-06-21 09:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535505, 350429, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool.  I love the warm tones.  The title is great too!</td>', 'Cool.  I love the warm tones.  The title is great too!', '2006-06-21 09:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535508, 348120, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much more impactful if you utilized the maximum 640 pixelation allowed. I wish that there were at least one semblance of a flower still in the vase- maybe you could''ve put it there for a bit of punch.</td>', 'I think this would be much more impactful if you utilized the maximum 640 pixelation allowed. I wish that there were at least one semblance of a flower still in the vase- maybe you could''ve put it there for a bit of punch.', '2006-06-21 09:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535510, 350046, 15711, '<td valign="top">So pretty. Nice sharp focus and I like the silver light behind it. Very well done. 9</td>', 'So pretty. Nice sharp focus and I like the silver light behind it. Very well done. 9', '2006-06-21 09:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535512, 349476, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s certainly bokeh.  Great stop action as well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'That''s certainly bokeh.  Great stop action as well.  Nicely done.', '2006-06-21 09:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535515, 350241, 7743, '<td valign="top">The background is nice and soft.  I think showing less of the window and more of the background would make the image even better.</td>', 'The background is nice and soft.  I think showing less of the window and more of the background would make the image even better.', '2006-06-21 09:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535516, 349594, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely complementary colors. I like the use of negative space. Not too busy as some flower shots can be.  If I were to change anything, I might deepen the yellow tones just a smidge, but then... that might ruin the almost ethereal quality of the blossom. Just talking out loud. What the heck 10</td>', 'Lovely complementary colors. I like the use of negative space. Not too busy as some flower shots can be.  If I were to change anything, I might deepen the yellow tones just a smidge, but then... that might ruin the almost ethereal quality of the blossom. Just talking out loud. What the heck 10', '2006-06-21 09:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535517, 349981, 44242, '<td valign="top">this is cool. i presume they''re yellow flowers in the background... very nice effect and meets challenge IMO.</td>', 'this is cool. i presume they''re yellow flowers in the background... very nice effect and meets challenge IMO.', '2006-06-21 09:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535518, 349045, 44242, '<td valign="top">very interestign and abstract. like the bokeh for this challenge.</td>', 'very interestign and abstract. like the bokeh for this challenge.', '2006-06-21 09:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535519, 349033, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yikes. Great detailing on the bug.</td>', 'Yikes. Great detailing on the bug.', '2006-06-21 09:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535520, 350932, 7743, '<td valign="top">It''s always best to use the full size allowed.  Much too small to be able to judge the quality of the image.</td>', 'It''s always best to use the full size allowed.  Much too small to be able to judge the quality of the image.', '2006-06-21 09:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535522, 348954, 44242, '<td valign="top">this is good. great angle to keep DOF under control on the butterfly, and throw the background OOF. only critism is darkness of subject.</td>', 'this is good. great angle to keep DOF under control on the butterfly, and throw the background OOF. only critism is darkness of subject.', '2006-06-21 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535525, 350284, 44242, '<td valign="top">i think your title sums it up. the blur makes the bokeh harder to distinguish. good colors.</td>', 'i think your title sums it up. the blur makes the bokeh harder to distinguish. good colors.', '2006-06-21 09:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535526, 351017, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice play on words for those in the know. good bokeh.</td>', 'nice play on words for those in the know. good bokeh.', '2006-06-21 09:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535527, 349034, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect example for bokeh. Love the orange with the green and pink with that hint of black for POW. The composition is perfect. If this were advanced editing, I might suggest a slight sharpen on the head of the bug.  OR maybe I need another cup of coffee. :~D Still, a great image. 9</td>', 'Perfect example for bokeh. Love the orange with the green and pink with that hint of black for POW. The composition is perfect. If this were advanced editing, I might suggest a slight sharpen on the head of the bug.  OR maybe I need another cup of coffee. :~D Still, a great image. 9', '2006-06-21 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535528, 348678, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice sharpness... did you use fill flash on this. very nice.</td>', 'nice sharpness... did you use fill flash on this. very nice.', '2006-06-21 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535532, 348127, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wedding bouquet. I love the pastel sense of it. Great softness to the background with excellent focus and composition. There is slight grain on the flower  -  not necessarily bad, but I wonder what Neat Image would have done to alleviate that. Beautiful nonetheless (just talking out loud) 9.</td>', 'Looks like a wedding bouquet. I love the pastel sense of it. Great softness to the background with excellent focus and composition. There is slight grain on the flower  -  not necessarily bad, but I wonder what Neat Image would have done to alleviate that. Beautiful nonetheless (just talking out loud) 9.', '2006-06-21 09:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535533, 350081, 44242, '<td valign="top">Hi. bokeh is great, but i think the impact is lost a little because of the dark stems/leaves, and because the subject contains 5 flowers, rather than something simpler. good luck.</td>', 'Hi. bokeh is great, but i think the impact is lost a little because of the dark stems/leaves, and because the subject contains 5 flowers, rather than something simpler. good luck.', '2006-06-21 09:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535535, 350749, 44242, '<td valign="top">this is really nice. great separation from the background, and pleasing bokeh. good luck.</td>', 'this is really nice. great separation from the background, and pleasing bokeh. good luck.', '2006-06-21 09:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535537, 349663, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent close up.  I with there were maybe a bit more background to really enhance his perfect focus. Really nice details on that little guy.</td>', 'Excellent close up.  I with there were maybe a bit more background to really enhance his perfect focus. Really nice details on that little guy.', '2006-06-21 09:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535539, 350670, 30625, '<td valign="top">Well Done....</td>', 'Well Done....', '2006-06-21 09:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535541, 349764, 30625, '<td valign="top">Bokeh is nice...The angle sort of throws it off a tad.</td>', 'Bokeh is nice...The angle sort of throws it off a tad.', '2006-06-21 09:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535542, 349605, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and it certainly has the bokeh effect.  I''m sensing a touch of harshness with the lighting. I wonder if an adjustement of curves of levels couldn''t have helped that out a bit.  Overall, well done image though. 7</td>', 'Nicely composed and it certainly has the bokeh effect.  I''m sensing a touch of harshness with the lighting. I wonder if an adjustement of curves of levels couldn''t have helped that out a bit.  Overall, well done image though. 7', '2006-06-21 09:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
