(2535589, 349569, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a stand out. That tack sharp eye with the glint of light - wow.  The purple and red combination is killer! I like the diagonal line of it too with that little guy popping up out of the upper right corner, as well as the blurred line behind him on the left. Great job.</td>', 'What a stand out. That tack sharp eye with the glint of light - wow.  The purple and red combination is killer! I like the diagonal line of it too with that little guy popping up out of the upper right corner, as well as the blurred line behind him on the left. Great job.', '2006-06-21 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535591, 349408, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Nice use of off centering.  I think I''d use Neat Image to soften the grain of the background just a bit. I might also whiten up the petals a bit, as they have a slight gray cast. Having said that, still a good choice for the challenge and it certainly uses the bokeh effect.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Nice use of off centering.  I think I''d use Neat Image to soften the grain of the background just a bit. I might also whiten up the petals a bit, as they have a slight gray cast. Having said that, still a good choice for the challenge and it certainly uses the bokeh effect.', '2006-06-21 09:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2535595, 350746, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really pretty. I like the shine on the leaf to detail all of the veins. I wish there were a hint of another color in the backgorund, but the monochromatic green theme has some merit as well.  Nice focus and I like the softened background.  Good effort. 8</td>', 'Really pretty. I like the shine on the leaf to detail all of the veins. I wish there were a hint of another color in the backgorund, but the monochromatic green theme has some merit as well.  Nice focus and I like the softened background.  Good effort. 8', '2006-06-21 09:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
