(2536337, 349952, 41066, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 because it is a simple yet stunning shot.  It goes to show, you do not need to have a lot of things in a shot to achieve excellence.  I love the color combinations too!  Well done!</td>', 'I gave this a 9 because it is a simple yet stunning shot.  It goes to show, you do not need to have a lot of things in a shot to achieve excellence.  I love the color combinations too!  Well done!', '2006-06-21 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
