(2536351, 350829, 41066, '<td valign="top">I love this!  You got a 9 from me!  Your shell is in perfect focus and the pattern on the outside and inside really make it stand out brilliantly against the sand and the sea bokeh behind it.  Well done!</td>', 'I love this!  You got a 9 from me!  Your shell is in perfect focus and the pattern on the outside and inside really make it stand out brilliantly against the sand and the sea bokeh behind it.  Well done!', '2006-06-21 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
