(2536358, 350222, 34659, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you achieved this appearance in basic editing, but it''s very effective.  The bokeh is almost like stained glass - very cool.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'I don''t know how you achieved this appearance in basic editing, but it''s very effective.  The bokeh is almost like stained glass - very cool.  Beautiful image.', '2006-06-21 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
