(2538302, 349569, 50127, '<td valign="top">Red Lorikeet?<br/>The colors of this photo are just awesome!! The beak stands out great against its purple compliment and the rainbow lori in the background is terrific! Its great how you dont notice it right away. <br/>I love the way the red in the background echoes the shape of the birds body in the foreground (that looks like a wing, not sure). I also like how the wing helps bring your eye to the edge of the photo.<br/>I love this photo, it has a great feel to it (I love birds too, though, so you get extra points for that!) 10!!</td>', 'Red Lorikeet?The colors of this photo are just awesome!! The beak stands out great against its purple compliment and the rainbow lori in the background is terrific! Its great how you dont notice it right away. I love the way the red in the background echoes the shape of the birds body in the foreground (that looks like a wing, not sure). I also like how the wing helps bring your eye to the edge of the photo.I love this photo, it has a great feel to it (I love birds too, though, so you get extra points for that!) 10!!', '2006-06-21 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
