(2538346, 350474, 51538, '<td valign="top">A good idea and nice title too.  Water is all very nice.  Just that the leaf bokeh is not quite vibrant enough.  But given Basic rules it is hard to make it better. My only suggestion would have been to have the water flow in front of some backlit ferns.  ferns give a rather nice green light and also provide a complex bokeh, depending on the lens...</td>', 'A good idea and nice title too.  Water is all very nice.  Just that the leaf bokeh is not quite vibrant enough.  But given Basic rules it is hard to make it better. My only suggestion would have been to have the water flow in front of some backlit ferns.  ferns give a rather nice green light and also provide a complex bokeh, depending on the lens...', '2006-06-21 21:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
