(2539525, 349948, 18367, '<td valign="top">This image is one that I am confident will remain an absolute treasure in your family album, and one that you will cherish with your child when it gets older.<br/> <br/>That being said... it is seriously devoid of the prime criteria for this challenge, namely "Bokeh".  This image is indeed a keeper, but I fear it may not score all that well in this challenge.</td>', 'This image is one that I am confident will remain an absolute treasure in your family album, and one that you will cherish with your child when it gets older. That being said... it is seriously devoid of the prime criteria for this challenge, namely "Bokeh".  This image is indeed a keeper, but I fear it may not score all that well in this challenge.', '2006-06-22 01:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
