(2541529, 349952, 11854, '<td valign="top">I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely vibrant colors, nice subject and bokeh.</td>', 'I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely vibrant colors, nice subject and bokeh.', '2006-06-22 16:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541530, 350413, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yes, yes!  Very creative.  Wonderful idea and well captured.  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Yes, yes!  Very creative.  Wonderful idea and well captured.  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-06-22 16:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541533, 347921, 11854, '<td valign="top">I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely vibrant colors, nice subject and bokeh. This could have been significantly improved without that red blurred berry at the top right though. It''s just too bright to blend into the background.</td>', 'I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely vibrant colors, nice subject and bokeh. This could have been significantly improved without that red blurred berry at the top right though. It''s just too bright to blend into the background.', '2006-06-22 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541534, 348856, 11854, '<td valign="top">I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely colors, nice subject and bokeh.</td>', 'I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely colors, nice subject and bokeh.', '2006-06-22 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541535, 348028, 11854, '<td valign="top">I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely colors, nice subject and bokeh.</td>', 'I already voted, now back for comments. I gave you an 8 on this shot. Lovely colors, nice subject and bokeh.', '2006-06-22 16:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541536, 349981, 60600, '<td valign="top">I love it! little swallow - so cute!! That one tall piece of grass in the center - the kind we used to chew on as kids - really adds that winning touch to this photograph, love the BG, wouldn''t change a thing! First 10 I''ve ever given!</td>', 'I love it! little swallow - so cute!! That one tall piece of grass in the center - the kind we used to chew on as kids - really adds that winning touch to this photograph, love the BG, wouldn''t change a thing! First 10 I''ve ever given!', '2006-06-22 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541537, 350413, 42196, '<td valign="top">the blue?<br/>Excellent concept.</td>', 'the blue?Excellent concept.', '2006-06-22 16:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541539, 350048, 60600, '<td valign="top">great bokeh - and great use of reflections too</td>', 'great bokeh - and great use of reflections too', '2006-06-22 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541541, 350553, 42196, '<td valign="top">cheesy</td>', 'cheesy', '2006-06-22 16:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541544, 350020, 60600, '<td valign="top">great concept, the bokeh would really work even better if the BG weren''t so busy. there''s a lot going on back there - trees, clothesline, fence, tin roof, blue flowers? maybe a slightly different angle could get rid of some of that extraneous stuff, great idea for bokeh!</td>', 'great concept, the bokeh would really work even better if the BG weren''t so busy. there''s a lot going on back there - trees, clothesline, fence, tin roof, blue flowers? maybe a slightly different angle could get rid of some of that extraneous stuff, great idea for bokeh!', '2006-06-22 16:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541548, 349158, 60600, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of color and macro! I think the white out-of-focus thing on the bottom right corner detracts from the image a little, distracting but not really focused enough to make me interested in what it might be. Beautiful shot!!</td>', 'beautiful use of color and macro! I think the white out-of-focus thing on the bottom right corner detracts from the image a little, distracting but not really focused enough to make me interested in what it might be. Beautiful shot!!', '2006-06-22 16:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541553, 349156, 60600, '<td valign="top">nice shot you have here, beautiful shades captured. blurry macro background isn''t so much adding interest to as focusing you to the foreground. still, a beautiful shot!</td>', 'nice shot you have here, beautiful shades captured. blurry macro background isn''t so much adding interest to as focusing you to the foreground. still, a beautiful shot!', '2006-06-22 16:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541554, 350153, 30861, '<td valign="top">jejeje</td>', 'jejeje', '2006-06-22 16:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541558, 349011, 42196, '<td valign="top">like the grain.<br/>WB seems off tho</td>', 'like the grain.WB seems off tho', '2006-06-22 16:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541567, 350962, 42196, '<td valign="top">weird color treatment</td>', 'weird color treatment', '2006-06-22 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541573, 350809, 60600, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a male (young) rose-breasted grosbeak actually, but I could be wrong! great capture!!! The bokeh - background is almost too skewed to add to the shot - it seems kaleidoscope-ish, psychadelic, and kind of detracts from the bird/wire subject. Perhaps a closer crop would eliminate that distraction?</td>', 'I think it''s a male (young) rose-breasted grosbeak actually, but I could be wrong! great capture!!! The bokeh - background is almost too skewed to add to the shot - it seems kaleidoscope-ish, psychadelic, and kind of detracts from the bird/wire subject. Perhaps a closer crop would eliminate that distraction?', '2006-06-22 16:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541579, 349240, 60600, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot! I see this little ladybug walking along, minding his own business, when another ladybug starts traveling up the <i>other </i>branch (running parallel) and it becomes like a race. Awesome use of the bokeh to introduce ideas beyond the subject!!!</td>', 'beautiful shot! I see this little ladybug walking along, minding his own business, when another ladybug starts traveling up the other branch (running parallel) and it becomes like a race. Awesome use of the bokeh to introduce ideas beyond the subject!!!', '2006-06-22 16:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541593, 349980, 56826, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Beautiful colours and composition.</td>', 'Stunning.  Beautiful colours and composition.', '2006-06-22 16:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541595, 349734, 44441, '<td valign="top">color would have been better</td>', 'color would have been better', '2006-06-22 16:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541598, 348167, 60600, '<td valign="top">great shot, not sure the BG has a lot that "adds interest" to the antelope. It is a great shot, but the bokeh seems necessary for the portrait rather than adding interest.</td>', 'great shot, not sure the BG has a lot that "adds interest" to the antelope. It is a great shot, but the bokeh seems necessary for the portrait rather than adding interest.', '2006-06-22 16:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541600, 349544, 44441, '<td valign="top">very good!</td>', 'very good!', '2006-06-22 16:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541605, 350237, 56826, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Perfect in every way.  10</td>', 'Wow.  Perfect in every way.  10', '2006-06-22 16:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541606, 350362, 60600, '<td valign="top">cool shot - what did you feed this guy? looks like uranium! I love dragonflys!</td>', 'cool shot - what did you feed this guy? looks like uranium! I love dragonflys!', '2006-06-22 16:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541610, 350457, 60600, '<td valign="top">Here is a perfect use of bokeh! without the tree trunk on the left, this shot would not be nearly as interesting, in terms of composition. Very nice setup you have here - I''d love to see a series of these - closer, slightly angled, etc., as  in a progression from far to near. Very cool bokeh!!</td>', 'Here is a perfect use of bokeh! without the tree trunk on the left, this shot would not be nearly as interesting, in terms of composition. Very nice setup you have here - I''d love to see a series of these - closer, slightly angled, etc., as  in a progression from far to near. Very cool bokeh!!', '2006-06-22 16:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541616, 350952, 56826, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  You made a slithery snake look beautiful. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot!  You made a slithery snake look beautiful. Well done.', '2006-06-22 16:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541622, 349656, 60600, '<td valign="top">great use of the front and rear diasies. this one in front doesn''t seem too fragile though - seems rather bold to me. unless your title was referring to the other daisies ???</td>', 'great use of the front and rear diasies. this one in front doesn''t seem too fragile though - seems rather bold to me. unless your title was referring to the other daisies ???', '2006-06-22 16:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541628, 350567, 60600, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot - why is it so blue -- is that sky? looks like underwater almost. great shot. I don''t think the BG out-of-focus is so much of an added interest as necessary for the portrait.</td>', 'beautiful shot - why is it so blue -- is that sky? looks like underwater almost. great shot. I don''t think the BG out-of-focus is so much of an added interest as necessary for the portrait.', '2006-06-22 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541633, 350617, 56826, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot.  Really interesting.</td>', 'Very unique shot.  Really interesting.', '2006-06-22 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541639, 350075, 60600, '<td valign="top">very pretty shot, I like the composition. I think I''d like to see more of the fence ... and this kind of interest in the BG is exactly what this ''bokeh'' challenge is about.</td>', 'very pretty shot, I like the composition. I think I''d like to see more of the fence ... and this kind of interest in the BG is exactly what this ''bokeh'' challenge is about.', '2006-06-22 16:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541644, 348907, 60600, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the BG out-of-focus is so much of an added interest or ''bokeh'' as it is necessary for the portrait.</td>', 'I don''t think the BG out-of-focus is so much of an added interest or ''bokeh'' as it is necessary for the portrait.', '2006-06-22 16:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541645, 349950, 47704, '<td valign="top">Sized incorrectly.  1</td>', 'Sized incorrectly.  1', '2006-06-22 16:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541646, 350373, 60600, '<td valign="top">very nice, I thought the blue was a stream at first, then realized they are more flowers. nice bokeh - added interest!</td>', 'very nice, I thought the blue was a stream at first, then realized they are more flowers. nice bokeh - added interest!', '2006-06-22 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541648, 350475, 60600, '<td valign="top">I like the composure of this shot - would like to see even more flowers at the back so it seems like it goes on forever! pretty shot!</td>', 'I like the composure of this shot - would like to see even more flowers at the back so it seems like it goes on forever! pretty shot!', '2006-06-22 16:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541651, 351003, 60600, '<td valign="top">cool use of bokeh to interest you in the rest of the players in this set!</td>', 'cool use of bokeh to interest you in the rest of the players in this set!', '2006-06-22 16:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541653, 349047, 60600, '<td valign="top">nice composition, like the boldness of the main subject flower!</td>', 'nice composition, like the boldness of the main subject flower!', '2006-06-22 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541654, 350932, 20214, '<td valign="top">I would have scored your photo higher has it been a little larger.</td>', 'I would have scored your photo higher has it been a little larger.', '2006-06-22 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541655, 350430, 60600, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the BG out-of-focus is so much of an added interest as necessary for the portrait.</td>', 'I don''t think the BG out-of-focus is so much of an added interest as necessary for the portrait.', '2006-06-22 16:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541663, 349588, 60600, '<td valign="top">love the bridge. the bokeh makes it look hazy outside.</td>', 'love the bridge. the bokeh makes it look hazy outside.', '2006-06-22 16:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541664, 349569, 20214, '<td valign="top">Great colors and sharpeness.</td>', 'Great colors and sharpeness.', '2006-06-22 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541667, 350326, 60600, '<td valign="top">great shot! how''d you get so close to a (duck?) I don''t think the BG out-of-focus adds interest as much as makes the portrait.</td>', 'great shot! how''d you get so close to a (duck?) I don''t think the BG out-of-focus adds interest as much as makes the portrait.', '2006-06-22 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541673, 349347, 40019, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge and exhibits proper bokeh.  The subject matter leaves me wanting (not because it''s a flower - I have nothing against flowers - it just lacks a "wow" factor for me).  A little more sharpness on the rose would have been nice as well.  Pretty image! Good luck!</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge and exhibits proper bokeh.  The subject matter leaves me wanting (not because it''s a flower - I have nothing against flowers - it just lacks a "wow" factor for me).  A little more sharpness on the rose would have been nice as well.  Pretty image! Good luck!', '2006-06-22 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541674, 349666, 60600, '<td valign="top">I think the BG is out-of-focus more as would make the portrait good, although I''m a little intrigued by this bridge she''s on. The building / cars in the far back are distracting in that case, otherwise I love the girl and the bridge / walkway as bokeh.</td>', 'I think the BG is out-of-focus more as would make the portrait good, although I''m a little intrigued by this bridge she''s on. The building / cars in the far back are distracting in that case, otherwise I love the girl and the bridge / walkway as bokeh.', '2006-06-22 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541676, 349874, 20214, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a rose but is lacking enough "Bokeh" for me to score this shot any higher than a 7. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a rose but is lacking enough "Bokeh" for me to score this shot any higher than a 7. Keep up the good work.', '2006-06-22 17:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541677, 349549, 60600, '<td valign="top">cool, looks almost unreal. good composition and awesome color!!!</td>', 'cool, looks almost unreal. good composition and awesome color!!!', '2006-06-22 17:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541681, 349561, 60600, '<td valign="top">HOW did you get this??? It is beautiful! I don''t find interest in the background as part of the shot, so although I would rate the shot <i>itself </i>a <b>10</b>, I won''t rate it that high for this challenge because it''s more of a portrait blur.</td>', 'HOW did you get this??? It is beautiful! I don''t find interest in the background as part of the shot, so although I would rate the shot itself a 10, I won''t rate it that high for this challenge because it''s more of a portrait blur.', '2006-06-22 17:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541684, 351050, 60600, '<td valign="top">the background definitely adds the interest to this main-subject coneflower.I like that there are several at different depths! nice bokeh!</td>', 'the background definitely adds the interest to this main-subject coneflower.I like that there are several at different depths! nice bokeh!', '2006-06-22 17:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541688, 350676, 40019, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge and exhibits proper bokeh.  The subject matter leaves me wanting (not because it''s a flower - I have nothing against flowers - it just lacks a "wow" factor for me).  A little smaller aperture would have put more of the flower in focus as well.  It looks like you shot with 2.8 or 3.5, thus only capturing the front peddle of the flower - focusing in the center of the flower at those apertures (as opposed to the front peddle), would have produced a better image (IMO).  Good luck!</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge and exhibits proper bokeh.  The subject matter leaves me wanting (not because it''s a flower - I have nothing against flowers - it just lacks a "wow" factor for me).  A little smaller aperture would have put more of the flower in focus as well.  It looks like you shot with 2.8 or 3.5, thus only capturing the front peddle of the flower - focusing in the center of the flower at those apertures (as opposed to the front peddle), would have produced a better image (IMO).  Good luck!', '2006-06-22 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541690, 349709, 40019, '<td valign="top">The colors are fun, but the image it just too blurry.  The apple should have been in focus to really nail this image.</td>', 'The colors are fun, but the image it just too blurry.  The apple should have been in focus to really nail this image.', '2006-06-22 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541693, 350737, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool bokeh!  The gamut of background colors is pretty neat!  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool bokeh!  The gamut of background colors is pretty neat!  Good luck.', '2006-06-22 17:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541698, 350149, 20214, '<td valign="top">My only nit pic with this shot is that it''s to centered but I''m still giving you a 10 because I think it''s a great shot! I would have liked to seen it cropped a little tighter to the right.</td>', 'My only nit pic with this shot is that it''s to centered but I''m still giving you a 10 because I think it''s a great shot! I would have liked to seen it cropped a little tighter to the right.', '2006-06-22 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541699, 350734, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice studio image and ray of colors.</td>', 'Nice studio image and ray of colors.', '2006-06-22 17:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2541701, 349374, 60600, '<td valign="top">great use of bokeh here! great color!!!</td>', 'great use of bokeh here! great color!!!', '2006-06-22 17:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
