(2542069, 350542, 20941, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge beautifully! The background bokeh definately enhances the subject. Very nice work!</td>', 'Fits the challenge beautifully! The background bokeh definately enhances the subject. Very nice work!', '2006-06-22 18:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
