(2542081, 350544, 42792, '<td valign="top">Love the tones but the centered subject works less well for me.  Would have preferred more room on the right to follow its gaze.</td>', 'Love the tones but the centered subject works less well for me.  Would have preferred more room on the right to follow its gaze.', '2006-06-22 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
