(2542370, 350201, 57229, '<td valign="top">A very small picture of a man, with the title ''man'' entered in a challenge called ''bokeh''. Blurred foreground and blurred background, yes. I think the most ''bokeh''/''broken'' or blurred/indistinct thing about this challenge is the idea of what we''re supposed to be looking for. I actually like blurred pictures like this one, but I won''t give it more than 4 for now...</td>', 'A very small picture of a man, with the title ''man'' entered in a challenge called ''bokeh''. Blurred foreground and blurred background, yes. I think the most ''bokeh''/''broken'' or blurred/indistinct thing about this challenge is the idea of what we''re supposed to be looking for. I actually like blurred pictures like this one, but I won''t give it more than 4 for now...', '2006-06-22 20:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
