(2543145, 350469, 18367, '<td valign="top">There are a few issues with this image which need to be addressed:<br/>1. The first is that there is no Bokeh in this image;<br/>2. While you have managed good exposure on the face, a good portion of the remaining image is overblown;<br/>3. The time of day you opted for is not conducive to good lighting; and lastly;<br/>4. A spelling mistake in the title could have a negative effect on your score.<br/> <br/>While I realize that I have not said any positive concerning image, I would urge you to continue with your photographic endeavours.  One only gets better with time and practice.</td>', 'There are a few issues with this image which need to be addressed:1. The first is that there is no Bokeh in this image;2. While you have managed good exposure on the face, a good portion of the remaining image is overblown;3. The time of day you opted for is not conducive to good lighting; and lastly;4. A spelling mistake in the title could have a negative effect on your score. While I realize that I have not said any positive concerning image, I would urge you to continue with your photographic endeavours.  One only gets better with time and practice.', '2006-06-22 23:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
