(2544431, 350047, 18073, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot and nice suturated colours but the slanted horizon is very distracting for me.  <br/> <br/>Its hard to tell if the horizon is off kilter intentionally or if it was a decision on your part.  I awlays think if you decide to try a sloping horizon you should make it obvious to the viewer by increasing the angle more than you have here.</td>', 'Very pretty shot and nice suturated colours but the slanted horizon is very distracting for me.   Its hard to tell if the horizon is off kilter intentionally or if it was a decision on your part.  I awlays think if you decide to try a sloping horizon you should make it obvious to the viewer by increasing the angle more than you have here.', '2006-06-23 08:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
