(2544509, 350096, 41066, '<td valign="top">So very delicate!  Great Bokeh background - 8 from me!</td>', 'So very delicate!  Great Bokeh background - 8 from me!', '2006-06-23 09:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544512, 349908, 41066, '<td valign="top">I love this!  This is a lovely clean shot and your wheat/grass strand really stands out against your bokeh background!  8 from me!</td>', 'I love this!  This is a lovely clean shot and your wheat/grass strand really stands out against your bokeh background!  8 from me!', '2006-06-23 09:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544519, 349445, 41066, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this with the background in focus as the main focus is the bright orange of the monks!  It is a great shot however and I am really jealous that you live somewhere where you can get shots like this!  Well done!</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this with the background in focus as the main focus is the bright orange of the monks!  It is a great shot however and I am really jealous that you live somewhere where you can get shots like this!  Well done!', '2006-06-23 09:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544520, 350544, 41066, '<td valign="top">Strong and powerful photograph.  Great use of bokeh!</td>', 'Strong and powerful photograph.  Great use of bokeh!', '2006-06-23 09:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544537, 351019, 41066, '<td valign="top">This looks like it would be perfect for front page of a newspaper!  Great Capture!</td>', 'This looks like it would be perfect for front page of a newspaper!  Great Capture!', '2006-06-23 09:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544540, 349594, 41066, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, I can see where your title came from..such a delicate yellow.  It is wonderfully contrasted against your soft purple bokeh background!  Great capture!</td>', 'Oh yes, I can see where your title came from..such a delicate yellow.  It is wonderfully contrasted against your soft purple bokeh background!  Great capture!', '2006-06-23 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544542, 350423, 41066, '<td valign="top">This looks like it should be on a postcard..simply beautiful.  Well Done!</td>', 'This looks like it should be on a postcard..simply beautiful.  Well Done!', '2006-06-23 09:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544545, 350308, 41066, '<td valign="top">I love the richness of the colors in bokeh background in contrast to the delicate yellow of the flower.  Great combination of color and fabulous challenge entry!</td>', 'I love the richness of the colors in bokeh background in contrast to the delicate yellow of the flower.  Great combination of color and fabulous challenge entry!', '2006-06-23 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544577, 348436, 30049, '<td valign="top">I have an outtake similar to this.  ;^)  I like the way you composed this with the diagonal across the image.  The shadows on the main fern are kinda cool, from the leaves above).  Not really seeing too much bokeh in here (you''ve probably already heard that...).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have an outtake similar to this.  ;^)  I like the way you composed this with the diagonal across the image.  The shadows on the main fern are kinda cool, from the leaves above).  Not really seeing too much bokeh in here (you''ve probably already heard that...). Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-23 10:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544580, 349498, 30049, '<td valign="top">I hope you''ve put this in a frame somewhere.  It''s a wonderful, fun capture of this young fella.  I''m hard pressed to find any bokeh in this shot however.  Don''t worry...not voting, just browsing.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'I hope you''ve put this in a frame somewhere.  It''s a wonderful, fun capture of this young fella.  I''m hard pressed to find any bokeh in this shot however.  Don''t worry...not voting, just browsing.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-06-23 10:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544581, 349295, 30049, '<td valign="top">Decent bokeh here, just nothing really interesting to look at concerning the main subject.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Decent bokeh here, just nothing really interesting to look at concerning the main subject.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-06-23 10:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544583, 347812, 30049, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your bg is far enough removed from the focal point to create any bokeh.  Another factor is there isn''t any backlighting to help generate interesting bokeh.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think your bg is far enough removed from the focal point to create any bokeh.  Another factor is there isn''t any backlighting to help generate interesting bokeh.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-23 10:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544585, 349656, 43519, '<td valign="top">10, simple and great bokeh...</td>', '10, simple and great bokeh...', '2006-06-23 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544586, 350112, 43519, '<td valign="top">There is not bokeh!4</td>', 'There is not bokeh!4', '2006-06-23 10:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544587, 348851, 30049, '<td valign="top">This works.  Interesting subject and bokeh in the background.  Nice focus on the eyes and well composed overall.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This works.  Interesting subject and bokeh in the background.  Nice focus on the eyes and well composed overall.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-23 10:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
