(2544590, 349368, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph!  Sharp, well focused, great color pop with the yellow.  Love the DOF to isolate the primary subject.  Not seeing much for bokeh in here, but don''t worry I''m just browsing.  ;^)  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph!  Sharp, well focused, great color pop with the yellow.  Love the DOF to isolate the primary subject.  Not seeing much for bokeh in here, but don''t worry I''m just browsing.  ;^)  Good luck!', '2006-06-23 10:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
