(2544594, 349476, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  Sharp, well focused image of this hummingbird.  Some decent bokeh working in the background.  Should do ok with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great catch!  Sharp, well focused image of this hummingbird.  Some decent bokeh working in the background.  Should do ok with this.  Good luck.', '2006-06-23 10:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
