(2544601, 348187, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  The image is a little soft for my liking.  The color is good and you have some nice bokeh going on in the bg.  The main subject seems a bit underexposed.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice title.  The image is a little soft for my liking.  The color is good and you have some nice bokeh going on in the bg.  The main subject seems a bit underexposed.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-06-23 10:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544603, 348663, 43519, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. Good luck. 10</td>', 'Lovely picture. Good luck. 10', '2006-06-23 10:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544654, 348028, 12857, '<td valign="top">Very very nice work.  I usually dont care for flower picks ( if you can call thistle a flower) but when one is done well I have to appreciate it.  The colors are fantastic,  The focus is well distributed and the bokeh is very complimentary.  Great Image.</td>', 'Very very nice work.  I usually dont care for flower picks ( if you can call thistle a flower) but when one is done well I have to appreciate it.  The colors are fantastic,  The focus is well distributed and the bokeh is very complimentary.  Great Image.', '2006-06-23 10:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544658, 348381, 24913, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity...</td>', 'I love the clarity...', '2006-06-23 10:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544663, 348663, 36006, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, nice texture, the focal plane seems to be n the ladies shoulder so therefore soft on the rest of the image, good tones, ok light, nice movement</td>', 'Nice comp, nice texture, the focal plane seems to be n the ladies shoulder so therefore soft on the rest of the image, good tones, ok light, nice movement', '2006-06-23 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544665, 348103, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is pretty darn cute and it makes for a great image.  I wish there was a catch light in his eyes...</td>', 'This is pretty darn cute and it makes for a great image.  I wish there was a catch light in his eyes...', '2006-06-23 10:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544666, 349482, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lost some detail on noise cleanup but nonetheless a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lost some detail on noise cleanup but nonetheless a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-23 10:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544669, 351022, 36006, '<td valign="top">finally something besides a flower.<br/> <br/>interesting idea, nice comp, great movement, nice light, good color, interesting texture,</td>', 'finally something besides a flower. interesting idea, nice comp, great movement, nice light, good color, interesting texture,', '2006-06-23 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544670, 349175, 12857, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I dont know if people will like your interpretation of Bokeh but I think this is great.  I especially love the movment in the image and your wonderful use of colors.   I think I would have liked it better withoutthe water droplet.  Greta Job</td>', 'I love this image.  I dont know if people will like your interpretation of Bokeh but I think this is great.  I especially love the movment in the image and your wonderful use of colors.   I think I would have liked it better withoutthe water droplet.  Greta Job', '2006-06-23 10:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544675, 351019, 36006, '<td valign="top">finally, no flowers.<br/> <br/>comp but cutting the wheels off of the athlete makes him look disconnected, great movement and the blue sign on right could of been cropped out making the bg cleaner, nice lines, light nice, color ok, great txture, great emotinonal value,</td>', 'finally, no flowers. comp but cutting the wheels off of the athlete makes him look disconnected, great movement and the blue sign on right could of been cropped out making the bg cleaner, nice lines, light nice, color ok, great txture, great emotinonal value,', '2006-06-23 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544679, 349293, 12857, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Tighg crop was essential.  WOnderful use of bokeh. I have seen this done 1000 times but you captured an image I still want to look at.  Good job. 9</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Tighg crop was essential.  WOnderful use of bokeh. I have seen this done 1000 times but you captured an image I still want to look at.  Good job. 9', '2006-06-23 11:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544682, 350140, 36006, '<td valign="top">what no flower???;)<br/>great comp, blacks too deep, whites not there, crisp, nice movement, nice texture, light good,</td>', 'what no flower???;)great comp, blacks too deep, whites not there, crisp, nice movement, nice texture, light good,', '2006-06-23 11:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544688, 348678, 12857, '<td valign="top">This image is interesting to look at.  You definately understand Bokeh and used it well in this image.  I get a very surreal feeling when looking at this .  The more I come back to visit it the higher and higher your score goes. The only thing that bothers me is that it looks like he is floating on his side.  I know it is the angle you chose.  I wonder if a straight on shot would have been better, but who knows you may have lost that perfect background.  Either way Good job</td>', 'This image is interesting to look at.  You definately understand Bokeh and used it well in this image.  I get a very surreal feeling when looking at this .  The more I come back to visit it the higher and higher your score goes. The only thing that bothers me is that it looks like he is floating on his side.  I know it is the angle you chose.  I wonder if a straight on shot would have been better, but who knows you may have lost that perfect background.  Either way Good job', '2006-06-23 11:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544690, 349660, 48228, '<td valign="top">Cool "Bokeh" in the background, and this composition it really strong</td>', 'Cool "Bokeh" in the background, and this composition it really strong', '2006-06-23 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544691, 350621, 36006, '<td valign="top">Yes, good title.<br/> <br/>Highly impressionistic, great comp, excellent color,great light, excellent movement, barely got your focal plane on the red flower, whites a bit blown but nt disturbingly, blacks ok,</td>', 'Yes, good title. Highly impressionistic, great comp, excellent color,great light, excellent movement, barely got your focal plane on the red flower, whites a bit blown but nt disturbingly, blacks ok,', '2006-06-23 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544692, 349908, 12857, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I love the composition.  I love the colors.  The focuse is tac sharp.  So based on both technical and artistic merits you must be presented with a 10  ( let me tell you I did not give many of those out in this challenge)</td>', 'Very well done.  I love the composition.  I love the colors.  The focuse is tac sharp.  So based on both technical and artistic merits you must be presented with a 10  ( let me tell you I did not give many of those out in this challenge)', '2006-06-23 11:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544693, 348103, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is very cute.  A little soft overall I think.  It would work very well if the face (to include nose and eyes especially) were sharply focused.</td>', 'This is very cute.  A little soft overall I think.  It would work very well if the face (to include nose and eyes especially) were sharply focused.', '2006-06-23 11:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544694, 350153, 12857, '<td valign="top">I am laughing out loud.  Thank you for that.</td>', 'I am laughing out loud.  Thank you for that.', '2006-06-23 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2544697, 349217, 12857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  This one really works for me.  The focus is tack sharp.  The lighting is suberb.  The bokeh adds all of the mood to the photo.  Great job 10.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  This one really works for me.  The focus is tack sharp.  The lighting is suberb.  The bokeh adds all of the mood to the photo.  Great job 10.', '2006-06-23 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
