(2545349, 350430, 70, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what makes you think this is a ribbon winner, exactly. It''s a decent shot but there isn''t anything especially stunning about it. There is bokeh but the dark black spot and the fact that the lighter spots are a similar but much brighter shade than her jacket both draw attention away from the subject so I''m not sure I''d consider it a strong addition to the photo. That, in addition to her shiny ring, make me look many places other than her face. Perhaps a stronger catchlight in the eyes would help draw attention to the proper place. Without the title, I''m not sure that I''d figure she was daydreaming - she looks more like she''s less than interested in being there. I think it''s a fine photo but lacking in anything that will pull it above the rest.</td>', 'I''m not sure what makes you think this is a ribbon winner, exactly. It''s a decent shot but there isn''t anything especially stunning about it. There is bokeh but the dark black spot and the fact that the lighter spots are a similar but much brighter shade than her jacket both draw attention away from the subject so I''m not sure I''d consider it a strong addition to the photo. That, in addition to her shiny ring, make me look many places other than her face. Perhaps a stronger catchlight in the eyes would help draw attention to the proper place. Without the title, I''m not sure that I''d figure she was daydreaming - she looks more like she''s less than interested in being there. I think it''s a fine photo but lacking in anything that will pull it above the rest.', '2006-06-23 14:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
