(2546836, 350430, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a nice job selecting a bg to get a good bokeh result.  DOF used works out just right.  Your title works as well with the bokeh giving the shot a dreamy kind of feel (with the subjects expression also of course).  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Prof - After your post in the Black &amp; White conversion thread I found this entry of yours right away.  I was using a bit of sarcasm in the thread.  Now I''m curious how you tried to hide it?</td>', 'You''ve done a nice job selecting a bg to get a good bokeh result.  DOF used works out just right.  Your title works as well with the bokeh giving the shot a dreamy kind of feel (with the subjects expression also of course).  Good luck in the challenge. Prof - After your post in the Black & White conversion thread I found this entry of yours right away.  I was using a bit of sarcasm in the thread.  Now I''m curious how you tried to hide it?', '2006-06-23 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
