(2548563, 350429, 52731, '<td valign="top">To me, this has a calm, soothing effect for some reason. I think it''s because the colors are so warm. The bokeh does enhance the subject, so great job.</td>', 'To me, this has a calm, soothing effect for some reason. I think it''s because the colors are so warm. The bokeh does enhance the subject, so great job.', '2006-06-24 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
