(2548575, 348187, 52731, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little soft on the flowers, but the background is very pretty. It looks like a painting, in a good way.</td>', 'Maybe a little soft on the flowers, but the background is very pretty. It looks like a painting, in a good way.', '2006-06-24 12:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
