(2549641, 350759, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very different.  I like the lighting on the foreground.  What is it anyway?  Not sure that it uses bokeh to its best ability, but not sure how you could have done it.  Maybe more light in the sky.</td>', 'Very different.  I like the lighting on the foreground.  What is it anyway?  Not sure that it uses bokeh to its best ability, but not sure how you could have done it.  Maybe more light in the sky.', '2006-06-24 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549644, 349950, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too small to get a really good impact.  Foreground could be sharper to separate it further from the background.</td>', 'Too small to get a really good impact.  Foreground could be sharper to separate it further from the background.', '2006-06-24 21:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549665, 349062, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt at wildlife.  The eye and beak are placed well, but the leaves really do detract from the image.</td>', 'Nice attempt at wildlife.  The eye and beak are placed well, but the leaves really do detract from the image.', '2006-06-24 21:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549670, 348704, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needed to use a shallower dof.  If you have spot metering on your camera, that might have allowed you to get rid of the background to appear just as colors and dots.</td>', 'Needed to use a shallower dof.  If you have spot metering on your camera, that might have allowed you to get rid of the background to appear just as colors and dots.', '2006-06-24 21:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549675, 348786, 35602, '<td valign="top">The foreground blur does frame the ducks (swans?) very well.  Might have shown better bokeh if there was more light reflected behind the ducks to create that non-detail which is essential to bokeh.  Perhaps a different time of day.</td>', 'The foreground blur does frame the ducks (swans?) very well.  Might have shown better bokeh if there was more light reflected behind the ducks to create that non-detail which is essential to bokeh.  Perhaps a different time of day.', '2006-06-24 21:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
