(2550212, 350362, 60174, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  A little more depth of field would be nice on this one.  Just enough so that the whole tail were sharp.  I think that would add interest, plus the angle of the tail would help draw the eye through the photo.</td>', 'Nice colours.  A little more depth of field would be nice on this one.  Just enough so that the whole tail were sharp.  I think that would add interest, plus the angle of the tail would help draw the eye through the photo.', '2006-06-25 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
