(2550768, 351024, 60803, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, and out of the 300 I''ve seen so far it fits the theme best. I''d be very surprised if it doesn''t ribbon. Beautiful bokeh, and unlike the majority of shots that just have a smooth OOF area, this has (to me) real bokeh, the interesting points of light, which compliment the colour and shape of the subject.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, and out of the 300 I''ve seen so far it fits the theme best. I''d be very surprised if it doesn''t ribbon. Beautiful bokeh, and unlike the majority of shots that just have a smooth OOF area, this has (to me) real bokeh, the interesting points of light, which compliment the colour and shape of the subject.', '2006-06-25 03:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2550801, 349137, 60803, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and very clever use of bokeh. The only thing I''d change is to have the cue angled towards the balls in the background, right now it leads your eye out of the shot instead of towards the bokeh. Otherwise well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, and very clever use of bokeh. The only thing I''d change is to have the cue angled towards the balls in the background, right now it leads your eye out of the shot instead of towards the bokeh. Otherwise well done.', '2006-06-25 03:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
