(2553096, 349005, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject.  I like the photo because the roses are not what you would expect and it makes for some interesting colors.  I would have like to see the circles of bokeh a bit more pronounced for the challenge, but as for the image, I really like it.</td>', 'Very cool subject.  I like the photo because the roses are not what you would expect and it makes for some interesting colors.  I would have like to see the circles of bokeh a bit more pronounced for the challenge, but as for the image, I really like it.', '2006-06-25 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
