(2553117, 351022, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes, but no clear subject.  My eye doesn''t know what to look at.</td>', 'Interesting shapes, but no clear subject.  My eye doesn''t know what to look at.', '2006-06-25 23:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553120, 350946, 60862, '<td valign="top">Try to get the subject in sharper focus.  I''m guessing you need to close your aperture a bit more to get the DOF right.  Either that, or point the autofocus at a closer part of the flower.</td>', 'Try to get the subject in sharper focus.  I''m guessing you need to close your aperture a bit more to get the DOF right.  Either that, or point the autofocus at a closer part of the flower.', '2006-06-25 23:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553125, 348436, 60862, '<td valign="top">To me, this challenge is about finding a way for a blurry background to relate somehow to the subject.  You''ve done a nice job singling out the subject, but the background doesn''t play a role.</td>', 'To me, this challenge is about finding a way for a blurry background to relate somehow to the subject.  You''ve done a nice job singling out the subject, but the background doesn''t play a role.', '2006-06-25 23:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553126, 349755, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun angle!</td>', 'Fun angle!', '2006-06-25 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553129, 349207, 60862, '<td valign="top">Did you do this with Canon''s MyColors settings, a filter, or what?<br/> <br/>Either way, the colors are too washed out for my taste.</td>', 'Did you do this with Canon''s MyColors settings, a filter, or what? Either way, the colors are too washed out for my taste.', '2006-06-25 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553133, 348704, 60862, '<td valign="top">Try to get your model to look at the camera. :)</td>', 'Try to get your model to look at the camera. :)', '2006-06-25 23:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553137, 349979, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun idea.  The pepper''s washed out, though, as is the hand holding it.  since you''re opening up the aperture to get the narrow DOF, try doing this without a flash.  Your shutter speed might still be low enough to keep the ppper sharp.</td>', 'Fun idea.  The pepper''s washed out, though, as is the hand holding it.  since you''re opening up the aperture to get the narrow DOF, try doing this without a flash.  Your shutter speed might still be low enough to keep the ppper sharp.', '2006-06-25 23:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2553143, 348815, 60862, '<td valign="top">Kuduos for doing something other than birds, flowers, or bugs. :)<br/> <br/>The bread''s washed out, though, and the jars in the background are a little too blurry.  Try narrowing your aperture a bit - it''ll help with both problems<br/> <br/>With those solved, I would''ve given this a 7, esp. for the creativity.</td>', 'Kuduos for doing something other than birds, flowers, or bugs. :) The bread''s washed out, though, and the jars in the background are a little too blurry.  Try narrowing your aperture a bit - it''ll help with both problems With those solved, I would''ve given this a 7, esp. for the creativity.', '2006-06-26 00:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
