(2557882, 350455, 70, '<td valign="top">This photo is suffering from a few things. First and foremost, it seems to have quite a bit of artifacting, most likely from the method you''ve used to resize. I suspect someone has already mentioned it, but if not, take a look at this tutorial on preparing your images for challenges. //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26<br/> <br/>Secondly, it looks like you used an on-camera flash and that it gave you quite harsh lighting in the foreground. <br/> <br/>Lastly, the background is quite distracting and unfortunately not out of focus enough to help support the subject of your photo. A wider aperture and more distance between your subject and background can help with that.</td>', 'This photo is suffering from a few things. First and foremost, it seems to have quite a bit of artifacting, most likely from the method you''ve used to resize. I suspect someone has already mentioned it, but if not, take a look at this tutorial on preparing your images for challenges. //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26 Secondly, it looks like you used an on-camera flash and that it gave you quite harsh lighting in the foreground.  Lastly, the background is quite distracting and unfortunately not out of focus enough to help support the subject of your photo. A wider aperture and more distance between your subject and background can help with that.', '2006-06-27 13:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2557883, 350026, 59138, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a chickadee to me... Nice capture! The diagonal patterns in the bokeh does distract a bit, but nice nonetheless.</td>', 'Looks more like a chickadee to me... Nice capture! The diagonal patterns in the bokeh does distract a bit, but nice nonetheless.', '2006-06-27 13:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
