(2558256, 347809, 59200, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty good. There were a lot of flowers and kids in this challenge, but this one stood out for me. I think the little girl is just the right amount of out-of-focusness. Still very visable but not the focus. Very nice composition!</td>', 'I thought this was pretty good. There were a lot of flowers and kids in this challenge, but this one stood out for me. I think the little girl is just the right amount of out-of-focusness. Still very visable but not the focus. Very nice composition!', '2006-06-27 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558258, 349763, 59200, '<td valign="top">I really liked the composition on this one. Subject isnt all that interesting but its made good by just how they are positioned and the bokeh. Very nice!</td>', 'I really liked the composition on this one. Subject isnt all that interesting but its made good by just how they are positioned and the bokeh. Very nice!', '2006-06-27 15:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558262, 350048, 59200, '<td valign="top">Enjoyed seeing something besides people and flowers. I thought the composition was very nice.</td>', 'Enjoyed seeing something besides people and flowers. I thought the composition was very nice.', '2006-06-27 15:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558264, 350584, 59200, '<td valign="top">You really did a good job catching intersting colors and patterns. The image would have been too busy if it werent for the depth of field. Nice image!</td>', 'You really did a good job catching intersting colors and patterns. The image would have been too busy if it werent for the depth of field. Nice image!', '2006-06-27 15:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558265, 350424, 59200, '<td valign="top">There were quite a few images like this in the challenge but this one stood out as particularly well composed and beliveable. Nice colors and bokeh!</td>', 'There were quite a few images like this in the challenge but this one stood out as particularly well composed and beliveable. Nice colors and bokeh!', '2006-06-27 15:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558269, 347877, 60861, '<td valign="top">you nailed it...</td>', 'you nailed it...', '2006-06-27 15:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558279, 350924, 59200, '<td valign="top">Thought this idea was very unique, it''s probably my favorite creatively. Although I think it could have been executed a little better. The B is nicely out of focus but I wish the box, timer and H were more unfocused. Also I think I can tell you used unsharp mask or something similar to fix the focus on the K.</td>', 'Thought this idea was very unique, it''s probably my favorite creatively. Although I think it could have been executed a little better. The B is nicely out of focus but I wish the box, timer and H were more unfocused. Also I think I can tell you used unsharp mask or something similar to fix the focus on the K.', '2006-06-27 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558281, 350519, 59200, '<td valign="top">Of all the many flower images in this challenge this one stood out. I think the composition of the single flower and the contrast of the orange with the sky and clouds are really well done.</td>', 'Of all the many flower images in this challenge this one stood out. I think the composition of the single flower and the contrast of the orange with the sky and clouds are really well done.', '2006-06-27 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558287, 349137, 59200, '<td valign="top">Like that this was a diffrent subject than any others. I also thought you used the Bokeh to enhance the idea behind the image, focusing on the cue ball. Very Nice.</td>', 'Like that this was a diffrent subject than any others. I also thought you used the Bokeh to enhance the idea behind the image, focusing on the cue ball. Very Nice.', '2006-06-27 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558291, 350178, 59200, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the contrast of the spikey plant with the soft feeling of the bokeh. Also I think you did a really good job getting the round circles of light they talked about.</td>', 'I really like the composition and the contrast of the spikey plant with the soft feeling of the bokeh. Also I think you did a really good job getting the round circles of light they talked about.', '2006-06-27 15:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558297, 350020, 59200, '<td valign="top">Thought this was an interesting take on the subject. Composition could have been slightly better. If you were at more of an angle or less centered. Good Job though.</td>', 'Thought this was an interesting take on the subject. Composition could have been slightly better. If you were at more of an angle or less centered. Good Job though.', '2006-06-27 15:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558298, 350429, 59200, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed the subject and composition of this piece. Your small depth of field is amazing.</td>', 'I enjoyed the subject and composition of this piece. Your small depth of field is amazing.', '2006-06-27 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558300, 349660, 59200, '<td valign="top">Thought this was a very intersting compostion. The subject isnt all that intersting, but ints really enhanced by the placement in the image and the contrast of colors. Nice Job.</td>', 'Thought this was a very intersting compostion. The subject isnt all that intersting, but ints really enhanced by the placement in the image and the contrast of colors. Nice Job.', '2006-06-27 15:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558305, 351019, 59200, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and conveyed a great idea. Composition is pretty good. I just wish there was slightly more contrast or interest along the sides of picture. Maybe you could up contrast and crop to be more portrait instead of landscape.</td>', 'Nice subject and conveyed a great idea. Composition is pretty good. I just wish there was slightly more contrast or interest along the sides of picture. Maybe you could up contrast and crop to be more portrait instead of landscape.', '2006-06-27 15:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558311, 350600, 59200, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the compostion of this one. The detail on thee wood is amazing. The contrast of the small drops with the waterfall is also very nice.</td>', 'I like the subject and the compostion of this one. The detail on thee wood is amazing. The contrast of the small drops with the waterfall is also very nice.', '2006-06-27 15:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558314, 349584, 59200, '<td valign="top">Great subject! The compostion is made much better by the blurred background.</td>', 'Great subject! The compostion is made much better by the blurred background.', '2006-06-27 15:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558317, 349415, 59200, '<td valign="top">Great subject and compostion. I particluarly like the words on the tape and the angles of the ropes. Very Nice!</td>', 'Great subject and compostion. I particluarly like the words on the tape and the angles of the ropes. Very Nice!', '2006-06-27 15:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2558319, 351033, 59200, '<td valign="top">I thought the bokeh was particularly nice in this shot. It really adds to the fairyland feel of the image</td>', 'I thought the bokeh was particularly nice in this shot. It really adds to the fairyland feel of the image', '2006-06-27 15:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
