(2558328, 348381, 59200, '<td valign="top">Very Nice bokeh. The colors in the background are amazing. Subject and title are thought provoking. I almost wish it was focused a little lower though, less of the bag and more of the line. Nice image!</td>', 'Very Nice bokeh. The colors in the background are amazing. Subject and title are thought provoking. I almost wish it was focused a little lower though, less of the bag and more of the line. Nice image!', '2006-06-27 15:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
