(2558332, 351017, 59200, '<td valign="top">There is something I really like about this. Not the most interesting subject but it''s really enhanced by the contrasts. The color of the background the sharpness of the foreground. Very nice composition.</td>', 'There is something I really like about this. Not the most interesting subject but it''s really enhanced by the contrasts. The color of the background the sharpness of the foreground. Very nice composition.', '2006-06-27 15:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
