(2558347, 349482, 59200, '<td valign="top">There were quite a few flowers, bugs and butterflies in this challenge but I thought this one stood out. The contrast of colors, blue and green in the background and black red of the butterfly were very nice.</td>', 'There were quite a few flowers, bugs and butterflies in this challenge but I thought this one stood out. The contrast of colors, blue and green in the background and black red of the butterfly were very nice.', '2006-06-27 15:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
