(2558824, 350229, 57229, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but over-composed to my eye. The crown is too important to be so far up in the corner. I think if you want to use the ''rule of thirds'', then you should apply it to the crown alone, as the head and neck are secondary elements in the composition.<br/>If that sounds like I''m blowing hot air, then that''s probably what it is :-)</td>', 'Very nice shot, but over-composed to my eye. The crown is too important to be so far up in the corner. I think if you want to use the ''rule of thirds'', then you should apply it to the crown alone, as the head and neck are secondary elements in the composition.If that sounds like I''m blowing hot air, then that''s probably what it is :-)', '2006-06-27 18:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
