(2560077, 349488, 22975, '<td valign="top">okay, so this picture was NEVER supposed to see the light of day... i had done three versions: my original, a very saturated one, and this one.  i had the saturated one entered and decided to change it at the last minute... meant to upload the original, and voila!  i accidentally entered this one.<br/> <br/>this was a version i was playing with to show my dad the wonders of photoshop... i was just doing a VERY rough demonstration on gaussian blur... my skills are MUCH better than this photo would lead you to believe...<br/> <br/>yes, i''m mortified, and i''m sorry i made you look at it.  :)  please accept my humble apologies.<br/></td>', 'okay, so this picture was NEVER supposed to see the light of day... i had done three versions: my original, a very saturated one, and this one.  i had the saturated one entered and decided to change it at the last minute... meant to upload the original, and voila!  i accidentally entered this one. this was a version i was playing with to show my dad the wonders of photoshop... i was just doing a VERY rough demonstration on gaussian blur... my skills are MUCH better than this photo would lead you to believe... yes, i''m mortified, and i''m sorry i made you look at it.  :)  please accept my humble apologies.', '2006-06-28 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
