(2560205, 348346, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by zheka:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this is a nice photo, however, it lacks a main subject and is just too abstract for this challenge. It''s nice as a background, but it needs something in the foreground. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Maybe that''s because it''s... abstract?  What do you mean by "too abstract for the challenge", anyways?</td>', 'Originally posted by zheka: I think this is a nice photo, however, it lacks a main subject and is just too abstract for this challenge. It''s nice as a background, but it needs something in the foreground.  Maybe that''s because it''s... abstract?  What do you mean by "too abstract for the challenge", anyways?', '2006-06-28 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
