(2560209, 349217, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Marla on an excellent shot...you should do really well in the flower challenge as you do them really well...this really captured the whole BOKEH thing well...from the guy next to you in third place!</td>', 'Congratulations Marla on an excellent shot...you should do really well in the flower challenge as you do them really well...this really captured the whole BOKEH thing well...from the guy next to you in third place!', '2006-06-28 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2560214, 351010, 38267, '<td valign="top">Great job :).  Go Llama!</td>', 'Great job :).  Go Llama!', '2006-06-28 01:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2560218, 348346, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dragn:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this is a flower....I think its beautiful.  Not bokeh, but beautiful nontheless! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>What do you mean "not bokeh"?  There is very little in the shot but bokeh, actually.  Translated from Japanese, bokeh means "fuzzy", that is the fuzzy rendition of out of focus elements.  Here you see both front and back bokeh.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dragn: I think this is a flower....I think its beautiful.  Not bokeh, but beautiful nontheless!  What do you mean "not bokeh"?  There is very little in the shot but bokeh, actually.  Translated from Japanese, bokeh means "fuzzy", that is the fuzzy rendition of out of focus elements.  Here you see both front and back bokeh.', '2006-06-28 01:34:56.000000', NULL, 0),
