(2560237, 348346, 48890, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all who voted this image above average.  Personally, I might not have given it a 10, but I think that it deserves a well above average mark.  This shows me, yet again, that the most of the DPC crowd cannot perceive an image as a visual object - they need to see a sharp subject, or else the picture is "out of focus".  Nothing unexpected, really.</td>', 'Thank you to all who voted this image above average.  Personally, I might not have given it a 10, but I think that it deserves a well above average mark.  This shows me, yet again, that the most of the DPC crowd cannot perceive an image as a visual object - they need to see a sharp subject, or else the picture is "out of focus".  Nothing unexpected, really.', '2006-06-28 01:39:05.000000', NULL, 0),
