(2560883, 349482, 12930, '<td valign="top">Great Shot ,but I found Your background too messy.If it had been possible I think that you should have cut out the leaf going right across the picture which would have given your butterfly more space and the bright leaf coming into the frame from the top which I found very distracting.I know these things are not easy to do at the time but I always cary a small pair of scissors.<br/>Congrats on top ten placing.</td>', 'Great Shot ,but I found Your background too messy.If it had been possible I think that you should have cut out the leaf going right across the picture which would have given your butterfly more space and the bright leaf coming into the frame from the top which I found very distracting.I know these things are not easy to do at the time but I always cary a small pair of scissors.Congrats on top ten placing.', '2006-06-28 07:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
