(2560902, 349482, 21430, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone.<br/> <br/>  This shot was really tough, as it was taken inside the Detroit Zoo''s Butterfly Exhibit. It''s hot in there and the Butterflies are zipping around like they have had to much caffeine..<br/> <br/>   Plus, there''s lot''s of people around at all times...<br/> <br/>   I took about 15 shots in there and this one came out the best.</td>', 'Thanks everyone.   This shot was really tough, as it was taken inside the Detroit Zoo''s Butterfly Exhibit. It''s hot in there and the Butterflies are zipping around like they have had to much caffeine..    Plus, there''s lot''s of people around at all times...    I took about 15 shots in there and this one came out the best.', '2006-06-28 07:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
