(2560956, 350719, 53147, '<td valign="top">Now I feel really bad here. Had I voted on enough shots for them to count you would have recieved an 8 from me. Alas, I did not make it through for some reason. I really liked this from the thumbnail on. Maybe a little soft on the face detail but a lovely shot and something different from all of the birds and flowers and such. Good job BeeCee - you should have scored better.</td>', 'Now I feel really bad here. Had I voted on enough shots for them to count you would have recieved an 8 from me. Alas, I did not make it through for some reason. I really liked this from the thumbnail on. Maybe a little soft on the face detail but a lovely shot and something different from all of the birds and flowers and such. Good job BeeCee - you should have scored better.', '2006-06-28 08:15:35.000000', NULL, 0),
