(2561410, 348584, 42125, '<td valign="top">It looks like there is some kind of animal luring there behind waiting to catch that butterfly. But it isn''t :-)<br/>Great photo and congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'It looks like there is some kind of animal luring there behind waiting to catch that butterfly. But it isn''t :-)Great photo and congratulations on your ribbon.', '2006-06-28 10:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
