(2561462, 349697, 50695, '<td valign="top">congratulations! I didn''t vote in this challenge but I would have given this a high mark. That is gorgeous, gorgeous bokeh (which is what my glass shot needs).</td>', 'congratulations! I didn''t vote in this challenge but I would have given this a high mark. That is gorgeous, gorgeous bokeh (which is what my glass shot needs).', '2006-06-28 10:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561488, 350222, 42100, '<td valign="top">Well you were definately right, that is some pretty cool bokeh you have  there!  Awesome photo Rachel!  I don''t get those comments about the bottom, it''s part of what makes this photo and it''s perfectly balanced the way it is now.</td>', 'Well you were definately right, that is some pretty cool bokeh you have  there!  Awesome photo Rachel!  I don''t get those comments about the bottom, it''s part of what makes this photo and it''s perfectly balanced the way it is now.', '2006-06-28 10:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561493, 349217, 24550, '<td valign="top">would love to see set up shots for this, if you have them available.<br/>great image.</td>', 'would love to see set up shots for this, if you have them available.great image.', '2006-06-28 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561508, 349569, 48245, '<td valign="top">Man... I thought this picture was from someone in San Antonio. I have a number of photos of these guys! Good job.<br/> <br/>Dang... you missed the ribbon by .0000389.<br/> <br/>That is what I call close!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-28 10:06:57.</i></td>', 'Man... I thought this picture was from someone in San Antonio. I have a number of photos of these guys! Good job. Dang... you missed the ribbon by .0000389. That is what I call close!', '2006-06-28 10:54:39.000000', '2006-06-28 11:06:57.000000', 0);
