(2561589, 349697, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 3rd place finish!  Very cool capture - Love the composition and lighting.</td>', 'Congrats on your 3rd place finish!  Very cool capture - Love the composition and lighting.', '2006-06-28 11:12:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561596, 350882, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Wow, I read your last comment in your photo''s notes and thought you were talking about me, LOL. I thought, "Now how did she know?". Back to your picture... Beautiful flower shot! It''s a shame we all got shot down on these. Your bokeh is excellent.</td>', 'Trading post...  Wow, I read your last comment in your photo''s notes and thought you were talking about me, LOL. I thought, "Now how did she know?". Back to your picture... Beautiful flower shot! It''s a shame we all got shot down on these. Your bokeh is excellent.', '2006-06-28 11:13:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2561600, 349569, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sandy!!!!  WTG!  This is GREAT!  :-)</td>', 'Congratulations Sandy!!!!  WTG!  This is GREAT!  :-)', '2006-06-28 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
