(2561622, 349217, 55427, '<td valign="top">Holy crud! You did a lot of work to create this image! Congrats on the ribbon! I''m amazed how people come up with these kinds of ideas... Wow.</td>', 'Holy crud! You did a lot of work to create this image! Congrats on the ribbon! I''m amazed how people come up with these kinds of ideas... Wow.', '2006-06-28 11:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
