(2561668, 349217, 16230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!<br/> <br/>My first thought when this photo came up during voting was, "This is going to win." My second thought was, "I wish I had taken this."<br/> <br/>Beautiful work Marla! You get a standing ovation with whistling from me. :D<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon! My first thought when this photo came up during voting was, "This is going to win." My second thought was, "I wish I had taken this." Beautiful work Marla! You get a standing ovation with whistling from me. :D ', '2006-06-28 11:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
