(2562621, 348584, 9668, '<td valign="top">Jason, beautiful shot and congrats on yet another blue. Look forward to seeing your other two ribbons (or more) this year.</td>', 'Jason, beautiful shot and congrats on yet another blue. Look forward to seeing your other two ribbons (or more) this year.', '2006-06-28 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2562647, 349569, 32378, '<td valign="top">Sandy, this is a fantastic shot.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Sandy, this is a fantastic shot.  Congratulations.', '2006-06-28 15:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2562672, 350417, 19670, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Jason. I actually did desaturate (both in RawShooter and Photoshop) due to the red being too strong. The lawn doesn''t show that it''s blown out according to the histogram, but that doesn''t mean it''s not too bright for the shot''s composition.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the critique!</td>', 'Thanks, Jason. I actually did desaturate (both in RawShooter and Photoshop) due to the red being too strong. The lawn doesn''t show that it''s blown out according to the histogram, but that doesn''t mean it''s not too bright for the shot''s composition. Thanks for the critique!', '2006-06-28 15:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2562675, 348584, 40370, '<td valign="top">What a majestic profile pose you got from this little wonder. The white body and neon green really make this butterfly "soar" above the rest. Congrats on the blue ribbon and an image likely to be chosen as a favorite many times over.</td>', 'What a majestic profile pose you got from this little wonder. The white body and neon green really make this butterfly "soar" above the rest. Congrats on the blue ribbon and an image likely to be chosen as a favorite many times over.', '2006-06-28 15:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2562757, 349191, 20530, '<td valign="top">Well, I liked it and gave it an 8. There''s a good chance I was suffering from flower fatigue and was overly excited about this one. I like the shallow DOF and the balanced composition. There are things that might have made it better; but I''m sure you''ll get plenty of feedback, from more knowledgable members, regarding those.</td>', 'Well, I liked it and gave it an 8. There''s a good chance I was suffering from flower fatigue and was overly excited about this one. I like the shallow DOF and the balanced composition. There are things that might have made it better; but I''m sure you''ll get plenty of feedback, from more knowledgable members, regarding those.', '2006-06-28 15:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2562782, 348663, 20530, '<td valign="top">I think you got robbed! This photo is so nice and should have scored higher, IMHO. It''s so touching and emotive that the "feel good" quality far overshadows the technical nitpicks. I gave it a 9.</td>', 'I think you got robbed! This photo is so nice and should have scored higher, IMHO. It''s so touching and emotive that the "feel good" quality far overshadows the technical nitpicks. I gave it a 9.', '2006-06-28 16:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
