(2563167, 350746, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the colors.  Should have scored higher.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the colors.  Should have scored higher.', '2006-06-28 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563177, 350362, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave this picture a 7 which is quite good in my book.  I really did appreciate the way the canvas was separated into different colors.  Composition, therefore, is quite nice.  Two nitpicks.  One, I don''t like the highlight on the branch in the middle of the picture.  It competes too much for our eye''s attention.  Second, I would have liked to see more of the bug in focus.  The DOF here is razor thin and had you been able to keep more of the little guy in focus while maintaining a blurry background, I think this shot could have soared.<br/> <br/>I guess if I gave you a 7, I''d consider your final score to have sold you quite a bit short.</td>', 'I gave this picture a 7 which is quite good in my book.  I really did appreciate the way the canvas was separated into different colors.  Composition, therefore, is quite nice.  Two nitpicks.  One, I don''t like the highlight on the branch in the middle of the picture.  It competes too much for our eye''s attention.  Second, I would have liked to see more of the bug in focus.  The DOF here is razor thin and had you been able to keep more of the little guy in focus while maintaining a blurry background, I think this shot could have soared. I guess if I gave you a 7, I''d consider your final score to have sold you quite a bit short.', '2006-06-28 17:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563203, 348630, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''m a bit puzzled on this one.  4.99? I''d likely have given it a 6.  I think the composition is nice and the bokeh is quite nice here.  Umm, well, it was a flower.  That probably made the score a bit lower.  The flower is just a bit blown, that doesn''t help.  While I think the background is properly exposed, the greens of the subject are a bit underexposed.  So it looks like tough lighting.  You could probably have changed things in PS a bit, but you are limited in basic editing.</td>', 'Hmm, I''m a bit puzzled on this one.  4.99? I''d likely have given it a 6.  I think the composition is nice and the bokeh is quite nice here.  Umm, well, it was a flower.  That probably made the score a bit lower.  The flower is just a bit blown, that doesn''t help.  While I think the background is properly exposed, the greens of the subject are a bit underexposed.  So it looks like tough lighting.  You could probably have changed things in PS a bit, but you are limited in basic editing.', '2006-06-28 18:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563219, 349697, 42792, '<td valign="top">Congrats Enzo - those ribbons are starting to stack up!  Keep it up.</td>', 'Congrats Enzo - those ribbons are starting to stack up!  Keep it up.', '2006-06-28 18:11:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563223, 348584, 42792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue for very lovely greens!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue for very lovely greens!', '2006-06-28 18:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563232, 350936, 58048, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments.<br/>A lot of people pointed out the "out of focus" on the bird''s head. Yeah, that''s  a pity :(<br/>I didn''t take enough time to correctly set my camera when I took the pictures, and I had to do the focus manually because I was too close to the bird. Maybe I should have chosen a smaller aperture and try to calm down and take my time ;-)<br/>Well, better luck next time!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments.A lot of people pointed out the "out of focus" on the bird''s head. Yeah, that''s  a pity :(I didn''t take enough time to correctly set my camera when I took the pictures, and I had to do the focus manually because I was too close to the bird. Maybe I should have chosen a smaller aperture and try to calm down and take my time ;-)Well, better luck next time!', '2006-06-28 18:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563268, 349569, 37719, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Sandy!  VERY well done!  The colors are so rich and full.  The detail on your subject is excellent.  I love the composition and the crop you chose.  Very nice lines and balance between subject and the background.  You definitely nailed this one perfectly!  Excellent work!  Just added to favorites.  All I can say is the 1/2/3 votes must have been from people who were jealous because this is simply gorgeous!<br/> <br/>EDIT: should have been crop, not croop.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-28 20:22:01.</i></td>', 'Beautiful shot Sandy!  VERY well done!  The colors are so rich and full.  The detail on your subject is excellent.  I love the composition and the crop you chose.  Very nice lines and balance between subject and the background.  You definitely nailed this one perfectly!  Excellent work!  Just added to favorites.  All I can say is the 1/2/3 votes must have been from people who were jealous because this is simply gorgeous! EDIT: should have been crop, not croop.  ', '2006-06-28 18:19:53.000000', '2006-06-28 21:22:01.000000', 0),
(2563291, 350237, 53690, '<td valign="top">I love the green in the b/g and the sharpness on the center of the daisy.  I would like to see the petals a little bit more clearly, although you probably would have had to put a shade on the sun :).  I also agree that it would look superb if the petals of the top 2 daisies that are peeking into the shot were cropped out.</td>', 'I love the green in the b/g and the sharpness on the center of the daisy.  I would like to see the petals a little bit more clearly, although you probably would have had to put a shade on the sun :).  I also agree that it would look superb if the petals of the top 2 daisies that are peeking into the shot were cropped out.', '2006-06-28 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2563295, 348630, 11518, '<td valign="top">Bokeh is great, but the main problem is likely the blown highlight on the flower.  Your eyes get drawn to that bright spot and you don''t notice the rest.  For the average voter who spends 5 secs looking at the picture this is all they will notice.</td>', 'Bokeh is great, but the main problem is likely the blown highlight on the flower.  Your eyes get drawn to that bright spot and you don''t notice the rest.  For the average voter who spends 5 secs looking at the picture this is all they will notice.', '2006-06-28 18:26:17.000000', NULL, 0),
