(2564064, 350734, 6519, '<td valign="top">In response to the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=417170&amp;page=1#2564032" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">forum thread</a>: I prefer this one, the one you entered.<br/> <br/>I believe this isn''t what they call "good bokeh" (something about the shapes and just exactly how they should look, depending on the lens bla bla bla). <br/>However, THIS bokeh shouts to me - water, cool, swimming pool, etc - and therefore truly enhances the subject much more than the other ones which simply have a blurred background.</td>', 'In response to the forum thread: I prefer this one, the one you entered. I believe this isn''t what they call "good bokeh" (something about the shapes and just exactly how they should look, depending on the lens bla bla bla). However, THIS bokeh shouts to me - water, cool, swimming pool, etc - and therefore truly enhances the subject much more than the other ones which simply have a blurred background.', '2006-06-28 21:55:47.000000', NULL, 0),
