(2564522, 348187, 36371, '<td valign="top">With all the crap that went on in the forums about ''''how there were so many flowers in this challenge'''' I had to remark numerous times that I had a flower pegged for first place!! I defended you! I wanted to describe your photo, but of course, I couldn''t...<br/>But you DO have a winner here. I even requested it to be a fav during the voting!<br/>Thanks so much for sharing this photo. <br/>It is truly amazing! <br/>Your new fan,<br/>Becky</td>', 'With all the crap that went on in the forums about ''''how there were so many flowers in this challenge'''' I had to remark numerous times that I had a flower pegged for first place!! I defended you! I wanted to describe your photo, but of course, I couldn''t...But you DO have a winner here. I even requested it to be a fav during the voting!Thanks so much for sharing this photo. It is truly amazing! Your new fan,Becky', '2006-06-29 00:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
