(2565289, 349840, 39349, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jrtodd:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice finish Steve<br/> <br/>Edit to say 2 things:<br/> <br/>First: This was my 1000th comment, not many to some, but hey!<br/>Second: Steve this is the very best photo you have entered in any of the challenges. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you John, that truly means a lot to me. I can''t thank you enough for getting the photography spark lit in me again. This is one of those shots that just works on so many levels, but I have to give credit to the lens, it had a wonderful FIRST owner that trained it how to capture these kind of images! ;)<br/> <br/>edit to also say:<br/> <br/>Thank you everyone for the wonderful comments and praise, I really appreciate it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-29 05:06:05.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by jrtodd: Very nice finish Steve Edit to say 2 things: First: This was my 1000th comment, not many to some, but hey!Second: Steve this is the very best photo you have entered in any of the challenges.   Thank you John, that truly means a lot to me. I can''t thank you enough for getting the photography spark lit in me again. This is one of those shots that just works on so many levels, but I have to give credit to the lens, it had a wonderful FIRST owner that trained it how to capture these kind of images! ;) edit to also say: Thank you everyone for the wonderful comments and praise, I really appreciate it!', '2006-06-29 06:04:01.000000', '2006-06-29 06:06:05.000000', 0),
