(2565310, 349840, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, i did not see this photo, which is a real shame because to be honest i would have given it the blue if i could of.<br/>I think this is exactly why candid photography is the best kind.<br/>This is the best photo i''ve seen in a long time. I love it.<br/>I''m going to get specific because it would take too long.<br/>The crop, the lighting, the pose, the model, everything is perfect.<br/>Well done mate.</td>', 'Wow, i did not see this photo, which is a real shame because to be honest i would have given it the blue if i could of.I think this is exactly why candid photography is the best kind.This is the best photo i''ve seen in a long time. I love it.I''m going to get specific because it would take too long.The crop, the lighting, the pose, the model, everything is perfect.Well done mate.', '2006-06-29 06:24:55.000000', NULL, 0),
