(2565655, 350971, 14614, '<td valign="top">Well done - liked by the voters (and me - gave it an 8 and, if I had gotten around to comment on any shots would have recieved a "one of my favorites this challenge")<br/> <br/>You have mastered, in both the large and the small, the delicate interplay of muted tones - they always support and enhance the composition while never overpowering it.</td>', 'Well done - liked by the voters (and me - gave it an 8 and, if I had gotten around to comment on any shots would have recieved a "one of my favorites this challenge") You have mastered, in both the large and the small, the delicate interplay of muted tones - they always support and enhance the composition while never overpowering it.', '2006-06-29 10:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
