(2567384, 350934, 22975, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture on the fence... nice work!  <br/> <br/>PS, go to help &gt; contact &gt; DPChallenge - Equipment Addition/Change... and send a message to the admins and ask them to add your camera.  I had to do it a few months ago, and they had it done by the next day (probably sooner)!  :)</td>', 'I really like the texture on the fence... nice work!   PS, go to help > contact > DPChallenge - Equipment Addition/Change... and send a message to the admins and ask them to add your camera.  I had to do it a few months ago, and they had it done by the next day (probably sooner)!  :)', '2006-06-29 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 0),
