(2569742, 350775, 38496, '<td valign="top">I''m still chuckling over this one.  this was one of my top pics. The color and sharpness is fabulous, and I love the concept.</td>', 'I''m still chuckling over this one.  this was one of my top pics. The color and sharpness is fabulous, and I love the concept.', '2006-06-30 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 0),
