(2572145, 349415, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hey Faithless, I do think it''s a superb picture.  I can just see how, on this site which loves to be quite literal with its interpretations, it got shortchanged a bit.  Put this in another challenge and I''m sure it''s a 6+.</td>', 'Hey Faithless, I do think it''s a superb picture.  I can just see how, on this site which loves to be quite literal with its interpretations, it got shortchanged a bit.  Put this in another challenge and I''m sure it''s a 6+.', '2006-07-01 12:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2572264, 348584, 52299, '<td valign="top">GLAD  U RECEIVED FIRST PLACE.. HAVEN''T BEEN ON THE SITE FOR AWHILE..  THIS WAS MY ONLY VOTE..</td>', 'GLAD  U RECEIVED FIRST PLACE.. HAVEN''T BEEN ON THE SITE FOR AWHILE..  THIS WAS MY ONLY VOTE..', '2006-07-01 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2572464, 351048, 53147, '<td valign="top">Didnt much care for this one. The colors arent really pleasant and the distorted lines in the backdrop arent enhanced in a good way in the refraction. The shadow lines curling around are pretty much just a distraction and the blackness in the tip is a bit too much. I didnt vote in this challenge but probably would have gone a 4. While the background is blurry it just doesnt do much for the shot. (Hope this isnt too harsh, just figured I would throw a critical comment in along with the other praises).</td>', 'Didnt much care for this one. The colors arent really pleasant and the distorted lines in the backdrop arent enhanced in a good way in the refraction. The shadow lines curling around are pretty much just a distraction and the blackness in the tip is a bit too much. I didnt vote in this challenge but probably would have gone a 4. While the background is blurry it just doesnt do much for the shot. (Hope this isnt too harsh, just figured I would throw a critical comment in along with the other praises).', '2006-07-01 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2572810, 349755, 19311, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot with a fun creative angle.  Unfortunate it had to be used for this particular challenge because it dosen''t fit well.  Would have done in aweomse in lots of other challenges.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot with a fun creative angle.  Unfortunate it had to be used for this particular challenge because it dosen''t fit well.  Would have done in aweomse in lots of other challenges.', '2006-07-01 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2573010, 349369, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I see you got hammered in the voting...I feel bad.  The voters didn''t look closer to see the subject...but on the other hand it isn''t entirely there fault.  The restricted size on this site adds to the problem.  But not to worries.  I gave you a 7 because of the fantastic bokeh you captured.  The insects were definitely there but as many have stated during the voting...a main subject needs to basically hit the viewers in the face.  It is sad to have to do that as it restricts the photographers creativity...but not to worries.  Treat DPC as a client...but don''t let it control your entire creativity.</td>', 'Hmmm...I see you got hammered in the voting...I feel bad.  The voters didn''t look closer to see the subject...but on the other hand it isn''t entirely there fault.  The restricted size on this site adds to the problem.  But not to worries.  I gave you a 7 because of the fantastic bokeh you captured.  The insects were definitely there but as many have stated during the voting...a main subject needs to basically hit the viewers in the face.  It is sad to have to do that as it restricts the photographers creativity...but not to worries.  Treat DPC as a client...but don''t let it control your entire creativity.', '2006-07-01 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2573501, 348265, 43031, '<td valign="top">L = love it.</td>', 'L = love it.', '2006-07-01 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2574296, 350362, 37858, '<td valign="top">I have a problem with this picture in that so much of it is out of focus.  Now I realize that is the point of the challenge, but I would like to have more or even all of the insect in focus.  As it is, I find my eye drawn to the bright bokeh rather than to the insect.  Also, I keep looking at the little purple thingy down front.  My eye should not be drawn there either.<br/> <br/>Having said that, I like the colors a lot...and the very soft feel of the bokeh.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge because of my trip.  I probably would have given it a 5, possibly a 6.</td>', 'I have a problem with this picture in that so much of it is out of focus.  Now I realize that is the point of the challenge, but I would like to have more or even all of the insect in focus.  As it is, I find my eye drawn to the bright bokeh rather than to the insect.  Also, I keep looking at the little purple thingy down front.  My eye should not be drawn there either. Having said that, I like the colors a lot...and the very soft feel of the bokeh. I didn''t vote in this challenge because of my trip.  I probably would have given it a 5, possibly a 6.', '2006-07-02 07:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2574348, 350882, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading Post.<br/>I like this photo''s use of bokeh.  Very effective IMHO.  On the otherhand, I thought a couple of the white petals were a bit washed out.  This is not my favorite of your work by a long shot.  I gave it a 5 because it seemed average to me.</td>', 'Trading Post.I like this photo''s use of bokeh.  Very effective IMHO.  On the otherhand, I thought a couple of the white petals were a bit washed out.  This is not my favorite of your work by a long shot.  I gave it a 5 because it seemed average to me.', '2006-07-02 08:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2574389, 350672, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading Post<br/> <br/>I love the color and the focus.  Nicely done.  Bokeh could have been a larger feature by cropping further out from the flower.  Over all, though I think this is one of your better efforts.  I would have given this a 6, possibly 7 with more bokeh.</td>', 'Trading Post I love the color and the focus.  Nicely done.  Bokeh could have been a larger feature by cropping further out from the flower.  Over all, though I think this is one of your better efforts.  I would have given this a 6, possibly 7 with more bokeh.', '2006-07-02 09:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2574752, 350413, 27763, '<td valign="top">Creative.  I thought you might enter something with circular OOF points :) You are definitely a macro master, and you''re on my short list of favorite photographers.  But what bothers me about this shot is the lighting on the spoon and table.  IMO, it is too harsh.  Many areas are "blown" to pure white. Although, of course, there''s nothing necessarily wrong with that, it just isn''t working for me on this shot.  Personally, I would have used a more diffused light and taken care not to blow highlights.  I think that would have given the shot a more pleasing, gentler feel (not to mention a more "professional", DPChallenge-voter-pleasing look!) But that''s just me :)<br/> <br/>Great colors as always :)</td>', 'Creative.  I thought you might enter something with circular OOF points :) You are definitely a macro master, and you''re on my short list of favorite photographers.  But what bothers me about this shot is the lighting on the spoon and table.  IMO, it is too harsh.  Many areas are "blown" to pure white. Although, of course, there''s nothing necessarily wrong with that, it just isn''t working for me on this shot.  Personally, I would have used a more diffused light and taken care not to blow highlights.  I think that would have given the shot a more pleasing, gentler feel (not to mention a more "professional", DPChallenge-voter-pleasing look!) But that''s just me :) Great colors as always :)', '2006-07-02 13:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2574871, 350413, 5112, '<td valign="top">Thank you, Christopher, much appreciated.  So called "artistic license" doesn''t excuse poor execution.  I appreciate your insight.</td>', 'Thank you, Christopher, much appreciated.  So called "artistic license" doesn''t excuse poor execution.  I appreciate your insight.', '2006-07-02 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2575329, 350567, 57229, '<td valign="top">Beaut picture. I gave you 7, as it happens - my 7 worked better than yours - (or should that read that my seven was <i>meaner</i> than yours?). I''m not losing any sleep over my scores anyway, and I sure''s hell dont expect you to be losing sleep over yours. Congrats...</td>', 'Beaut picture. I gave you 7, as it happens - my 7 worked better than yours - (or should that read that my seven was meaner than yours?). I''m not losing any sleep over my scores anyway, and I sure''s hell dont expect you to be losing sleep over yours. Congrats...', '2006-07-02 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2575350, 348584, 42567, '<td valign="top">Very nice Doc!  Congratulations</td>', 'Very nice Doc!  Congratulations', '2006-07-02 19:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2575354, 349217, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Great picture!  Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2006-07-02 19:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
