(2580948, 349308, 19944, '<td valign="top">OOOOWWWWWW!  That''s nice.  Beautiful lighting, super sharp.  Nice clean flower.  Those Magnolias can get those nasty brown edges.  You nailed this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-03 20:57:40.</i></td>', 'OOOOWWWWWW!  That''s nice.  Beautiful lighting, super sharp.  Nice clean flower.  Those Magnolias can get those nasty brown edges.  You nailed this one.', '2006-07-03 21:33:33.000000', '2006-07-03 21:57:40.000000', 0),
