(2600562, 349569, 15305, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!!! Colors, composition and detail are great!!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!!! Colors, composition and detail are great!!', '2006-07-08 13:44:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2601220, 350882, 14414, '<td valign="top">Again, apologies for the delay<br/> <br/>I like how you have the one flower peering right out at you; this seems to give it some "character". The composition works well with the flowers on the left hand side, and the supporting bokeh on the right, Also, the bokeh matches well with the positioning of the 3 main flowers, and the just-visible background stem echos the stem of the main lilies.<br/>I guess there are SO many flower shots around that it doesn''t jump out at you, and I don''t really think it would have scored much beyond 5.5 even though it is compositionally etc very good - it just doesnt have enough of the punch/originality/whatever that flowers need to do well here (especially alongside &gt;400 entries!)<br/> <br/><i>more typos!</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-08 18:20:15.</i></td>', 'Again, apologies for the delay I like how you have the one flower peering right out at you; this seems to give it some "character". The composition works well with the flowers on the left hand side, and the supporting bokeh on the right, Also, the bokeh matches well with the positioning of the 3 main flowers, and the just-visible background stem echos the stem of the main lilies.I guess there are SO many flower shots around that it doesn''t jump out at you, and I don''t really think it would have scored much beyond 5.5 even though it is compositionally etc very good - it just doesnt have enough of the punch/originality/whatever that flowers need to do well here (especially alongside >400 entries!) more typos!', '2006-07-08 19:19:40.000000', '2006-07-08 19:20:15.000000', 0),
(2603471, 349840, 49326, '<td valign="top">I wonder why this one didn''t place higher. I love it. It''s sharp, has nice colors and bokeh and the subject is a beatiful woman that is framed nicely by her hair. Maybe she''s to centered but that didn''t irritate me. Maybe it''s because it was a candid but that is a positive thing to me. Congrats on your 26th place.</td>', 'I wonder why this one didn''t place higher. I love it. It''s sharp, has nice colors and bokeh and the subject is a beatiful woman that is framed nicely by her hair. Maybe she''s to centered but that didn''t irritate me. Maybe it''s because it was a candid but that is a positive thing to me. Congrats on your 26th place.', '2006-07-09 17:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2603643, 350164, 14414, '<td valign="top">Sorry to be so late with critiques<br/> <br/>I think you''ve succeeded well in capturing the bee with the flower, and enhancing it with b/g bokeh. The colours and the focus on the flower are good. The main problem here for me is that the bee is soft - I''m not sure if that is motion blur or if the bee is outside the plane of focus. I would also prefer the background flowers to be slightly further away (or shallower DOF) to enhance the bokeh.<br/> <br/>Also, a slight change in placement could have put the b/g flowers offset against the f/g flower, making the composition a touch less busy.<br/> <br/>I would suggest cropping in the righthand side so that the flower is not centralized.</td>', 'Sorry to be so late with critiques I think you''ve succeeded well in capturing the bee with the flower, and enhancing it with b/g bokeh. The colours and the focus on the flower are good. The main problem here for me is that the bee is soft - I''m not sure if that is motion blur or if the bee is outside the plane of focus. I would also prefer the background flowers to be slightly further away (or shallower DOF) to enhance the bokeh. Also, a slight change in placement could have put the b/g flowers offset against the f/g flower, making the composition a touch less busy. I would suggest cropping in the righthand side so that the flower is not centralized.', '2006-07-09 18:06:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2603900, 350672, 14414, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, and should have done better I think. The only problem is that the bokeh seems rather arbitrary (and scarce), rather than an integral part that enhances the photo. <br/>However, outside of the challenge topic, I love the colours and the focus/DOF is perfect. Whilst the crop is quite tight, this works quite well I believe. <br/> <br/>I agree with others that in order to meet the challenge more you needed a wider pov to include more bokeh.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, and should have done better I think. The only problem is that the bokeh seems rather arbitrary (and scarce), rather than an integral part that enhances the photo. However, outside of the challenge topic, I love the colours and the focus/DOF is perfect. Whilst the crop is quite tight, this works quite well I believe.  I agree with others that in order to meet the challenge more you needed a wider pov to include more bokeh.', '2006-07-09 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608558, 348989, 37730, '<td valign="top">great bokeh and photo</td>', 'great bokeh and photo', '2006-07-10 20:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2609897, 350621, 42013, '<td valign="top">Wow, 10 favs!  Nice work.<br/> <br/>YOu definitely made the bokeh either a primary or strong secondary subject.  I feel as if the foreground flowers are framing the OOF floowers in the BG.  NOt sure how you achieved this effect but it is very paint-like.  Great finish in a challenge with ovre 400 entries.</td>', 'Wow, 10 favs!  Nice work. YOu definitely made the bokeh either a primary or strong secondary subject.  I feel as if the foreground flowers are framing the OOF floowers in the BG.  NOt sure how you achieved this effect but it is very paint-like.  Great finish in a challenge with ovre 400 entries.', '2006-07-11 03:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2611230, 350553, 45003, '<td valign="top">I know, a bit late ;) Great finish, Waz! Lovely photo.</td>', 'I know, a bit late ;) Great finish, Waz! Lovely photo.', '2006-07-11 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2611460, 349840, 52945, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.</td>', 'Excellent photo.', '2006-07-11 17:26:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2614921, 350237, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot but honestly, I would probably have given this a 5 in this challenge as I don´t really find it that interesting either.  To improve it I would crop out the petals that sneak into the frame from above, compose it more according to the rule of thirds and watch the highlights on the flower, I haven´t checked with a histogram verification but they seem blown out to me, if you use raw I would have darkened it there with exposure compensation and then brightened again with curves or levels or whatever you use.  Had you did those three things this would have been a much better image but like I said, not bat at all :)</td>', 'Not a bad shot but honestly, I would probably have given this a 5 in this challenge as I don´t really find it that interesting either.  To improve it I would crop out the petals that sneak into the frame from above, compose it more according to the rule of thirds and watch the highlights on the flower, I haven´t checked with a histogram verification but they seem blown out to me, if you use raw I would have darkened it there with exposure compensation and then brightened again with curves or levels or whatever you use.  Had you did those three things this would have been a much better image but like I said, not bat at all :)', '2006-07-12 14:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2618532, 349276, 40465, '<td valign="top">Hi from Cpt2!<br/> <br/>The colour against the grey background:)  It''s such a fun shot! Well done!!</td>', 'Hi from Cpt2! The colour against the grey background:)  It''s such a fun shot! Well done!!', '2006-07-13 11:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
