(2624020, 350746, 60862, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this a 5, so I think your score was pretty much on target.<br/> <br/>The leaf''s shape is interesting, its placement is good, and I think you did a nice job of focusing on it.<br/> <br/>My two suggestions reflect what I''m trying to remember at the moment:<br/>1) Watch out for the busy background.  That stem going low left to upper right really takes my eye away from the focused leaf.<br/> <br/>2) Low contrast between subject and background.  Same leaf, but in red or yellow, would have really made it pop out.  I''m not saying you could''ve found such a leaf, but I''d be curious how it''d look now if you tried it in post-processing.</td>', 'I would have voted this a 5, so I think your score was pretty much on target. The leaf''s shape is interesting, its placement is good, and I think you did a nice job of focusing on it. My two suggestions reflect what I''m trying to remember at the moment:1) Watch out for the busy background.  That stem going low left to upper right really takes my eye away from the focused leaf. 2) Low contrast between subject and background.  Same leaf, but in red or yellow, would have really made it pop out.  I''m not saying you could''ve found such a leaf, but I''d be curious how it''d look now if you tried it in post-processing.', '2006-07-15 01:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2629069, 349569, 60244, '<td valign="top">Sandy this is breathtaking!  The colors, the composition, the focus....<br/>wow!</td>', 'Sandy this is breathtaking!  The colors, the composition, the focus....wow!', '2006-07-17 08:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2629237, 350964, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey Tim.  That''s a nice shot.  Glad you left details.  I was curious how you got this angle.  Thought at first glance the spider was on glass.</td>', 'Hey Tim.  That''s a nice shot.  Glad you left details.  I was curious how you got this angle.  Thought at first glance the spider was on glass.', '2006-07-17 09:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
