(2767738, 350068, 34659, '<td valign="top">The centered composition really works well here due to the bokeh &amp; light "sparkles" leading off to the upper right.  Beautiful capture.</td>', 'The centered composition really works well here due to the bokeh & light "sparkles" leading off to the upper right.  Beautiful capture.', '2006-08-28 13:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
