(2800964, 349697, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful - the depth of field is perfect.  Makes me want to go out and buy a good macro lens... would probably help if I bought an SLR first though, LOL.</td>', 'This is so beautiful - the depth of field is perfect.  Makes me want to go out and buy a good macro lens... would probably help if I bought an SLR first though, LOL.', '2006-09-05 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2802331, 349569, 30608, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I forgot to give you props and congratulating you for such a fantastic finish on such a beautiful photograph. You are a pro behind your lens, and your edits are excellent. This has to be one of your best ever. Congratulations my friend!!</td>', 'I can''t believe I forgot to give you props and congratulating you for such a fantastic finish on such a beautiful photograph. You are a pro behind your lens, and your edits are excellent. This has to be one of your best ever. Congratulations my friend!!', '2006-09-05 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2812959, 350076, 13077, '<td valign="top">The framing in the trees is really nice, but some of the technical aspects of the photo could be better. It could be sharper overall, and definitely more dramatic processing with hue/sat and stuff like that would help. Plus it doesn''t really fit what most people think of for Bokeh.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-09 15:05:43.</i></td>', 'The framing in the trees is really nice, but some of the technical aspects of the photo could be better. It could be sharper overall, and definitely more dramatic processing with hue/sat and stuff like that would help. Plus it doesn''t really fit what most people think of for Bokeh.', '2006-09-07 23:30:00.000000', '2006-09-09 16:05:43.000000', 0),
(2817519, 350010, 61138, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this didn''t work. But I came back and took a closer look.<br/> <br/>I think you''ve used the DOF well, and it''s a nice treatment of the subject. Most motorcycle shots would have the bike in focus.<br/> <br/>I agree with another commentor that maybe cropping a little off the right side would help in the composition but, it''s already pretty nice.<br/> <br/>Good work.</td>', 'At first glance I thought this didn''t work. But I came back and took a closer look. I think you''ve used the DOF well, and it''s a nice treatment of the subject. Most motorcycle shots would have the bike in focus. I agree with another commentor that maybe cropping a little off the right side would help in the composition but, it''s already pretty nice. Good work.', '2006-09-09 11:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2820963, 349045, 36470, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty.  I think it had a lot of potential in the challenge and I think a little more DOF would have improved it.  Very creative composition.</td>', 'This is really pretty.  I think it had a lot of potential in the challenge and I think a little more DOF would have improved it.  Very creative composition.', '2006-09-10 18:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
