(3244517, 350567, 70828, '<td valign="top">SUMBEECH! That is an incredible capture! Title is very cute and apt too!<br/> <br/>To think you almost did not enter this. My heart!</td>', 'SUMBEECH! That is an incredible capture! Title is very cute and apt too! To think you almost did not enter this. My heart!', '2007-01-17 03:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3277519, 350237, 14986, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this shot and it''s very nice I think.  The petals do appear a bit blown out and lost some detail, and I agree that cropping out the upper bright petals at the top of the frame would give more impact to the rest of the shot.   The photo does appeal to me and I''d like to try a similar flower shot sometime.</td>', 'I love the idea of this shot and it''s very nice I think.  The petals do appear a bit blown out and lost some detail, and I agree that cropping out the upper bright petals at the top of the frame would give more impact to the rest of the shot.   The photo does appeal to me and I''d like to try a similar flower shot sometime.', '2007-01-24 20:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3352102, 350567, 7810, '<td valign="top">Love the colours ... great capture!</td>', 'Love the colours ... great capture!', '2007-02-11 00:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3501480, 350474, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the background here really is bokeh, but I''m no expert.  I do know that I really like the photo if it was cropped below the red spout...just showing the water against the background.  To me, that makes it a wow abstract style shot.  Neat colors.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the background here really is bokeh, but I''m no expert.  I do know that I really like the photo if it was cropped below the red spout...just showing the water against the background.  To me, that makes it a wow abstract style shot.  Neat colors.', '2007-03-31 02:50:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3503767, 350284, 20056, '<td valign="top">Featured Photographs... oh well, I should give some comment:<br/> <br/>The flower was in focus but the picture is in motion (I was in a swing); just one of my experiments with DOF, blur and motion.<br/> <br/>Regards... and keep experimenting :)</td>', 'Featured Photographs... oh well, I should give some comment: The flower was in focus but the picture is in motion (I was in a swing); just one of my experiments with DOF, blur and motion. Regards... and keep experimenting :)', '2007-04-01 04:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
