(3940914, 350567, 77365, '<td valign="top">Highlights are my biggest gremlin, shooting digital is a real challenge when it comes to keeping the highlights in control. I use a 2xND filter to help however it is a real issue. It is not an issue here so much  Jerry<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-26 19:57:09.</i></td>', 'Highlights are my biggest gremlin, shooting digital is a real challenge when it comes to keeping the highlights in control. I use a 2xND filter to help however it is a real issue. It is not an issue here so much  Jerry', '2007-07-26 20:56:25.000000', '2007-07-26 20:57:09.000000', 0),
(3976870, 349697, 65319, '<td valign="top">Your sense of humor found in your titles is only outdone by your spectacular photographs.  The clarity and DOF in this photo is just outstanding (can I borrow that lens?...hehe!)</td>', 'Your sense of humor found in your titles is only outdone by your spectacular photographs.  The clarity and DOF in this photo is just outstanding (can I borrow that lens?...hehe!)', '2007-08-07 11:51:36.000000', NULL, 0),
